('9a8e7c2c-aa7f-550e-a918-580086edb29b','d481c9ca-af3a-5da9-814b-7e0c267dae77',1,'noun','A2','S2','W1',null,'[{"phrase":"price war","register":null,"definition_en":"a situation in which several companies reduce the prices of what they sell , because they are all trying to get the most customers","translation":"وضعیتی که در آن چندین شرکت قیمت‌های آنچه را که می‌فروشند کاهش می‌دهند، زیرا همگی در تلاش هستند تا بیشترین مشتری را به دست آورند","example":"","example_translation":"","example_audio_url":""},{"phrase":"be in the wars","register":"spoken","definition_en":"used, often humorously, to say that someone has lots of injuries or health problems","translation":"اغلب به صورت طنز برای گفتن اینکه شخصی صدمات یا مشکلات سلامتی زیادی دارد استفاده می شود","example":"You’ve really been in the wars lately, haven’t you?","example_translation":"شما واقعاً اخیراً در جنگ ها بوده اید، اینطور نیست؟","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001682547.mp3"},{"phrase":"this means war","register":"spoken","definition_en":"used humorously to say that you are ready to fight or argue about something","translation":"به طنز برای گفتن اینکه شما آماده دعوا کردن یا بحث کردن در مورد چیزی هستید استفاده می شود","example":"","example_translation":"","example_audio_url":""}]'::jsonb),
('9e078c1f-64ab-5cb4-aa3f-0579fd961d40','0d361dd7-19f8-5481-9273-afbf23b05ddd',1,'noun','A1','S1','W1',null,'[{"phrase":"out of the way","register":null,"definition_en":"an out-of-the-way place is in an area where there are few people","translation":"یک مکان خارج از مسیر در منطقه ای است که افراد کمی در آن حضور داشته باشند","example":"an out-of-the-way spot for a picnic","example_translation":"مکانی دور از دسترس برای پیک نیک","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000383011.mp3"},{"phrase":"make your way","register":null,"definition_en":"to go towards something, especially when this is difficult or takes a long time","translation":"رفتن به سمت چیزی، به خصوص زمانی که این کار دشوار است یا زمان زیادی می برد","example":"The team slowly made their way back to base.","example_translation":"تیم به آرامی راه خود را به پایگاه بازگشت.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001802115.mp3"},{"phrase":"give way","register":null,"definition_en":"to be replaced by something else","translation":"با چیز دیگری جایگزین شود","example":"Stone has given way to glass and concrete.","example_translation":"سنگ جای خود را به شیشه و بتن داده است.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001802132.mp3"},{"phrase":"by way of something","register":null,"definition_en":"as a form or means of something","translation":"به عنوان شکل یا وسیله چیزی","example":"I’d like to say something by way of introduction.","example_translation":"به عنوان مقدمه می خواهم چیزی بگویم.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000511638.mp3"},{"phrase":"get in the way of something","register":null,"definition_en":"to prevent someone from doing something, or prevent something from happening","translation":"برای جلوگیری از انجام کاری یا جلوگیری از وقوع چیزی","example":"Your social life must not get in the way of your studies.","example_translation":"زندگی اجتماعی شما نباید مانع تحصیل شما شود.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000511312.mp3"},{"phrase":"by a long way","register":null,"definition_en":"by a large amount","translation":"با مقدار زیادی","example":"He was the best in the group by a long way.","example_translation":"او تا حد زیادی در گروه بهترین بود.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001802334.mp3"},{"phrase":"get into the way of doing something","register":null,"definition_en":"to start to do something regularly","translation":"شروع به انجام منظم کاری","example":"He’d got into the way of smoking first thing in the morning.","example_translation":"او اول صبح به سیگار کشیدن عادت کرده بود.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001802366.mp3"},{"phrase":"the way of the world","register":null,"definition_en":"how things always happen or are done, especially when this is not easy to change","translation":"چگونه همه چیز همیشه اتفاق می افتد یا انجام می شود، به خصوص زمانی که تغییر آن آسان نیست","example":"In those days these policies favoured men. That was the way of the world.","example_translation":"در آن روزها این سیاست ها به نفع مردان بود. این راه دنیا بود.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001802386.mp3"},{"phrase":"every which way","register":"informal","definition_en":"in every direction","translation":"در هر جهت","example":"The kids ran off every which way.","example_translation":"بچه ها از هر طرف فرار کردند.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001223608.mp3"},{"phrase":"by the way","register":null,"definition_en":"used when saying something that is not related to the main subject you were talking about before","translation":"وقتی چیزی را می گویید که به موضوع اصلی که قبلاً در مورد آن صحبت می کردید مربوط نیست","example":"By the way, have you seen my keys anywhere?","example_translation":"راستی، آیا کلیدهای من را جایی دیده ای؟","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001802409.mp3"},{"phrase":"the way I see it","register":null,"definition_en":"used before telling someone your opinion","translation":"قبل از اینکه نظر خود را به کسی بگویید استفاده می شود","example":"The way I see it, it was a fair trade.","example_translation":"آن طور که من آن را می بینم، یک تجارت منصفانه بود.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000511520.mp3"},{"phrase":"be with somebody all the way","register":null,"definition_en":"to agree with someone completely","translation":"با کسی کاملاً موافق بودن","example":"I’m with you all the way on this salary issue, Joe.","example_translation":"من در تمام راه در مورد این موضوع حقوق با شما هستم، جو.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000511515.mp3"}]'::jsonb),
