('c20612dd-601c-593d-bd32-cafd2e8f3931','28b03817-1beb-596e-8094-3c91e8871ac9',1,'verb','A1','S1','W1','( past tense and past participle won / wʌn / , present participle winning )','[{"phrase":"you win","register":"spoken","definition_en":"used to agree to what someone wants after you have tried to persuade them to do something else","translation":"پس از اینکه سعی کردید او را به انجام کار دیگری متقاعد کنید، با خواسته های شخصی موافقت می کردید","example":"OK, you win – we’ll go to the movies.","example_translation":"خوب، شما برنده می شوید - ما به سینما می رویم.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000488154.mp3"},{"phrase":"win or lose","register":"informal","definition_en":"no matter whether you win or lose","translation":"مهم نیست که برنده شوید یا ببازید","example":"Win or lose, I love competitive sports.","example_translation":"برد یا باخت، من عاشق ورزش های رقابتی هستم.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-002006690.mp3"},{"phrase":"win the day","register":null,"definition_en":"to finally be successful in a discussion or argument","translation":"تا در نهایت در یک بحث یا بحث موفق شوید","example":"Common sense won the day, and the plans were dropped.","example_translation":"عقل سلیم آن روز را برد و برنامه ها کنار گذاشته شدند.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000488174.mp3"}]'::jsonb),
