('c4edeffd-012e-5b51-b995-08f6a6be7d32','025bbe1c-423f-5fe9-a50f-3befe7de6991',1,'noun','A1','S2','W3','[ countable ] ( plural baths / bɑːðz, bɑːθs $ bæðz, bæθs / )','[{"phrase":"take a bath","register":"informal","definition_en":"to lose money, especially in a business deal","translation":"از دست دادن پول، به ویژه در یک معامله تجاری","example":"We took a bath in the market over that stock.","example_translation":"در بازار روی آن سهام حمام کردیم.","example_audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001003827.mp3"}]'::jsonb),
