('f8d3e9e0-14e1-5d7e-bf1d-f2f90222417d','bc07cfe3-0867-5947-b092-76cbd11269f5',1,'feeling unhappy','احساس ناراحتی','spoken & written','not happy , especially because something unpleasant has happened',null,null,'غمگین، اندوهگین؛ بد (حالت)؛ خراب (خبر)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Dad looked sad and worried as he read the letter.","translation":"پدر وقتی نامه را می خواند غمگین و نگران به نظر می رسید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001563588.mp3"},{"sentence":"I was very sad to hear that he had died.","translation":"با شنیدن خبر فوتش خیلی ناراحت شدم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001563591.mp3"},{"sentence":"Lilly felt sad that Christmas was over.","translation":"لیلی از اینکه کریسمس به پایان رسید ناراحت بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001563594.mp3"},{"sentence":"I was sad about the friends I was leaving behind.","translation":"برای دوستانی که پشت سر گذاشتم ناراحت بودم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000739585.mp3"},{"sentence":"There was such a sad look in her eyes.","translation":"چنان نگاه غمگینی در چشمانش بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000739588.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('fff51bb0-5777-5c2c-be04-211aea2649a0','bc07cfe3-0867-5947-b092-76cbd11269f5',2,'making you unhappy','شما را ناراضی می کند','spoken & written','a sad event , situation etc makes you feel unhappy',null,null,'یک رویداد غم انگیز، موقعیت و غیره باعث می شود شما احساس ناراحتی کنید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a sad story/song/film He had listened patiently to his client’s sad story about her awful life.','sad news It was with great shock that we heard the sad news that he had died.','a sad fact It’s a sad fact that a significant amount of crime is committed by young people.','the sad truth The sad truth is that the new law will not deter criminals.','a sad day/time I’m really disappointed that this happened. It’s a sad day for football.','a sad case Take the sad case of Gary Marsh, who was badly injured during a match.','a sad ending The film has a sad ending.','the sad thing (= the sad part of a situation ) The sad thing is that there’s little we can do about the situation now.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Sorry to hear the sad news .","translation":"متاسفم از شنیدن خبر ناراحت کننده.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000739598.mp3"},{"sentence":"It was a sad case . The boy ended up in prison.","translation":"مورد غم انگیزی بود. پسر در نهایت به زندان افتاد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001563598.mp3"},{"sentence":"a story with a sad ending","translation":"داستانی با پایانی غم انگیز","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000739601.mp3"},{"sentence":"It was sad to see them arguing.","translation":"دیدن مشاجره آنها ناراحت کننده بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000739607.mp3"},{"sentence":"This is a sad day for us all.","translation":"این روز برای همه ما غم انگیز است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000739610.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('5f951e51-baa1-5384-b94f-d647c7aa613d','bc07cfe3-0867-5947-b092-76cbd11269f5',3,'not satisfactory','رضایت بخش نیست','spoken','very bad or unacceptable',null,null,'خیلی بد یا غیر قابل قبول','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"There aren’t enough teachers, which is a sad state of affairs (= bad situation ) .","translation":"معلمان کافی وجود ندارد، که وضعیت غم انگیزی است (= وضعیت بد).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000739619.mp3"},{"sentence":"It’s sad if people are too afraid to go out alone at night.","translation":"غم انگیز است اگر مردم از بیرون رفتن تنها در شب ترس داشته باشند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001563604.mp3"},{"sentence":"The sad fact is that prejudice still exists.","translation":"واقعیت غم انگیز این است که تعصب هنوز وجود دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000739623.mp3"},{"sentence":"Sad to say (= unfortunately ) , the country is heading towards civil war.","translation":"متأسفانه گفتن (= متأسفانه) ، کشور به سمت جنگ داخلی پیش می رود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000739627.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('c6a53ff5-e07b-5046-bccc-39a601ec46c2','bc07cfe3-0867-5947-b092-76cbd11269f5',4,'lonely','تنها','spoken & written','a sad person has a dull , unhappy, or lonely life',null,null,'یک فرد غمگین زندگی کسل کننده، ناراحت یا تنهایی دارد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"She’s a sad character – without any friends at all.","translation":"او یک شخصیت غمگین است - بدون هیچ دوستی.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000739632.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('47511acf-1035-5a28-9fc2-5dd5c5aa9143','bc07cfe3-0867-5947-b092-76cbd11269f5',5,'boring','خسته کننده','informal','boring or not deserving any respect',null,null,'خسته کننده یا سزاوار هیچ احترامی نیست','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Stay in on Saturday night? What a sad idea!","translation":"شنبه شب در خانه بمانید؟ چه فکر غم انگیزی!","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001563606.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('25dc2cdb-0bdb-57ef-a87f-6372ed3b4f8b','bc07cfe3-0867-5947-b092-76cbd11269f5',6,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'sadder and/but wiser','غمگین، اندوهگین؛ بد (حالت)؛ خراب (خبر)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('f72b8334-374c-57ad-8583-81b7391adc25','17888898-e602-58e2-9665-785f4339c28c',1,null,null,'spoken & written','the abbreviation of',null,null,'مخفف','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('cf8ad3ad-80ea-5529-95e4-ee535a484d64','3ec6f48a-767e-5468-8376-3849936c556b',1,'express something in words','چیزی را با کلمات بیان کند','spoken & written','to express an idea, feeling, thought etc using words','[ intransitive only in negatives, transitive ]','see Thesaurus box on 000000','گفتن، بیان کردن؛ بیان داشتن (نظر)؛ دستور دادن','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['say hello/goodbye I came to say goodbye.','say thank you I just wanted to say thank you for being there.','say sorry/say that you’re sorry It was probably too late to say sorry.','say yes/no Some parents are unable to say no to their children.','say something/anything/nothing I was about to say something to him when he looked up and smiled.','say some words She stopped abruptly, suddenly afraid to say the words aloud.','say so If you don’t know the answer, don’t be afraid to say so.','a terrible/stupid/odd etc thing to say I know it’s a terrible thing to say, but I wish he’d just go away.','have something/anything/nothing to say He usually has something to say about just about everything.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"‘I’m so tired, ’ she said.","translation":"او گفت: \"خیلی خسته هستم.\"","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001793070.mp3"},{"sentence":"‘Don’t cry, ’ he said softly.","translation":"به آرامی گفت: گریه نکن.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001793071.mp3"},{"sentence":"Don’t believe anything he says.","translation":"هرچی میگه باور نکن","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000715854.mp3"},{"sentence":"A spokesman said that the company had improved its safety standards.","translation":"یک سخنگوی گفت که این شرکت استانداردهای ایمنی خود را بهبود بخشیده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000715861.mp3"},{"sentence":"I always said I would buy a motorbike when I had enough money.","translation":"همیشه می گفتم وقتی پول کافی داشته باشم موتور می خرم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000715862.mp3"},{"sentence":"Did she say what happened?","translation":"گفت چی شده؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000715865.mp3"},{"sentence":"I would like to say how much we appreciate your hard work.","translation":"می خواهم بگویم که چقدر از زحمات شما قدردانی می کنیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000715866.mp3"},{"sentence":"‘Why did she leave?’ ‘I don’t know – she didn’t say .’","translation":"\"چرا او رفت؟\" \"نمی دانم - او نگفت.\"","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000715855.mp3"},{"sentence":"What did you say to her?","translation":"بهش چی گفتی؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001793074.mp3"},{"sentence":"‘This is strange, ’ he said to himself.","translation":"با خود گفت: این عجیب است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce6exa_00758.mp3"},{"sentence":"What a silly thing to say!","translation":"چه حرف احمقانه ای!","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000715858.mp3"},{"sentence":"She left without saying goodbye.","translation":"بدون خداحافظی رفت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001793082.mp3"},{"sentence":"I’ve said I’m sorry – what more do you want?","translation":"گفتم متاسفم - دیگر چه می خواهید؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001825597.mp3"},{"sentence":"Can I go, Mum? Oh, please say yes!","translation":"میتونم برم مامان؟ اوه، لطفا بگویید بله!","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000715870.mp3"},{"sentence":"He looked as if he was going to say something.","translation":"انگار می خواست چیزی بگوید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001793093.mp3"},{"sentence":"I wished I had said nothing about Jordi.","translation":"کاش چیزی در مورد جوردی نگفته بودم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001793094.mp3"},{"sentence":"Does anyone else have anything to say?","translation":"آیا کس دیگری چیزی برای گفتن دارد؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000715876.mp3"},{"sentence":"Although he didn’t say so , it was clear that he was in pain.","translation":"اگرچه او این را نگفت، اما معلوم بود که درد دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001793095.mp3"},{"sentence":"What makes you say that (= why do you think that ) ?","translation":"چه چیزی باعث می شود که این را بگویید (= چرا چنین فکر می کنید)؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001793099.mp3"},{"sentence":"Nina said to meet her at 4.30.","translation":"نینا گفت که ساعت 4.30 با او ملاقات کنم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000715901.mp3"},{"sentence":"I’d like to say a few words (= make a short speech ) .","translation":"من می خواهم چند کلمه بگویم (= یک سخنرانی کوتاه).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001793107.mp3"},{"sentence":"‘So what are your plans now?’ ‘ I’d rather not say .’","translation":"«پس الان چه برنامه‌ای دارید؟» «ترجیح می‌دهم نگم.»","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000716043.mp3"}]'::jsonb,22),
('b37811bf-98aa-544c-bd92-f26f0c35328d','3ec6f48a-767e-5468-8376-3849936c556b',2,'give information','اطلاعات بده','spoken & written','to give information in the form of written words, numbers, or pictures – used about signs, clocks , letters , messages etc','[ transitive ]',null,'برای دادن اطلاعات در قالب کلمات نوشته شده، اعداد یا تصاویر - مورد استفاده در مورد علائم، ساعت، حروف، پیام ها و غیره','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['say hello/goodbye I came to say goodbye.','say thank you I just wanted to say thank you for being there.','say sorry/say that you’re sorry It was probably too late to say sorry.','say yes/no Some parents are unable to say no to their children.','say something/anything/nothing I was about to say something to him when he looked up and smiled.','say some words She stopped abruptly, suddenly afraid to say the words aloud.','say so If you don’t know the answer, don’t be afraid to say so.','a terrible/stupid/odd etc thing to say I know it’s a terrible thing to say, but I wish he’d just go away.','have something/anything/nothing to say He usually has something to say about just about everything.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The sign said ‘Back in 10 minutes.’","translation":"روی تابلو نوشته شده بود: «۱۰ دقیقه دیگر برمی‌گردیم».","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000715940.mp3"},{"sentence":"The clock said twenty past three.","translation":"ساعت سه و بیست و بیست را می گفت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001793113.mp3"},{"sentence":"He received a letter saying that the appointment had been cancelled.","translation":"نامه ای دریافت کرد مبنی بر لغو قرار ملاقات.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000715945.mp3"},{"sentence":"The label says to take one tablet before meals.","translation":"روی برچسب نوشته شده است که یک قرص قبل از غذا مصرف شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000715948.mp3"},{"sentence":"The card doesn’t even say who sent the flowers.","translation":"کارت حتی نمی گوید چه کسی گل ها را فرستاده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000715951.mp3"},{"sentence":"It says here they have live music.","translation":"اینجا می گوید موسیقی زنده دارند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001793120.mp3"}]'::jsonb,6),
('8b9debe8-9aed-5b58-b7ed-a235cfb84193','3ec6f48a-767e-5468-8376-3849936c556b',3,'mean','معنی','spoken & written','used to talk about what someone means','[ transitive ]',null,'در مورد معنای کسی صحبت می کرد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['say hello/goodbye I came to say goodbye.','say thank you I just wanted to say thank you for being there.','say sorry/say that you’re sorry It was probably too late to say sorry.','say yes/no Some parents are unable to say no to their children.','say something/anything/nothing I was about to say something to him when he looked up and smiled.','say some words She stopped abruptly, suddenly afraid to say the words aloud.','say so If you don’t know the answer, don’t be afraid to say so.','a terrible/stupid/odd etc thing to say I know it’s a terrible thing to say, but I wish he’d just go away.','have something/anything/nothing to say He usually has something to say about just about everything.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"What do you think the writer is trying to say in this passage?","translation":"فکر می کنید نویسنده در این قسمت چه چیزی را می خواهد بگوید؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000715958.mp3"},{"sentence":"So what you’re saying is, there’s none left.","translation":"بنابراین چیزی که شما می گویید این است که هیچ چیزی باقی نمانده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000715959.mp3"},{"sentence":"Are you saying I’m fat?","translation":"میگی چاقم؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000715962.mp3"},{"sentence":"I’m not saying it’s a bad idea.","translation":"من نمی گویم ایده بدی است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001793158.mp3"},{"sentence":"All I’m saying is that it might be better to wait a while.","translation":"تنها چیزی که می گویم این است که شاید بهتر باشد کمی صبر کنیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001793153.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('fe1d00f9-aea3-5006-9431-ca6755f6e236','3ec6f48a-767e-5468-8376-3849936c556b',4,'think that something is true','فکر کن چیزی درست است','spoken & written','used to talk about something that people think is true','[ transitive ]',null,'در مورد چیزی صحبت می کرد که مردم فکر می کردند درست است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['say hello/goodbye I came to say goodbye.','say thank you I just wanted to say thank you for being there.','say sorry/say that you’re sorry It was probably too late to say sorry.','say yes/no Some parents are unable to say no to their children.','say something/anything/nothing I was about to say something to him when he looked up and smiled.','say some words She stopped abruptly, suddenly afraid to say the words aloud.','say so If you don’t know the answer, don’t be afraid to say so.','a terrible/stupid/odd etc thing to say I know it’s a terrible thing to say, but I wish he’d just go away.','have something/anything/nothing to say He usually has something to say about just about everything.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"They say that she has been all over the world.","translation":"آنها می گویند که او در سراسر جهان بوده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001825610.mp3"},{"sentence":"It is said that he was a spy during the war.","translation":"می گویند در زمان جنگ جاسوس بوده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001825611.mp3"},{"sentence":"He’s said to be the richest man in the world.","translation":"گفته می شود که او ثروتمندترین مرد جهان است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001793136.mp3"},{"sentence":"Well, you know what they say – blood’s thicker than water.","translation":"خوب، می دانید چه می گویند - خون غلیظ تر از آب است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000715991.mp3"},{"sentence":"The rest, as they say , is history.","translation":"بقیه، همانطور که می گویند، تاریخ است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001793140.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('fb2ae05a-2621-59dd-9b47-055cffc4424a','3ec6f48a-767e-5468-8376-3849936c556b',5,'show/be a sign of something','نشان دادن/نشانه چیزی بودن','spoken & written','to show clearly that something is true about someone or something’s character','[ transitive ]',null,'به وضوح نشان دادن اینکه چیزی در مورد شخصیت کسی یا چیزی صادق است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['say hello/goodbye I came to say goodbye.','say thank you I just wanted to say thank you for being there.','say sorry/say that you’re sorry It was probably too late to say sorry.','say yes/no Some parents are unable to say no to their children.','say something/anything/nothing I was about to say something to him when he looked up and smiled.','say some words She stopped abruptly, suddenly afraid to say the words aloud.','say so If you don’t know the answer, don’t be afraid to say so.','a terrible/stupid/odd etc thing to say I know it’s a terrible thing to say, but I wish he’d just go away.','have something/anything/nothing to say He usually has something to say about just about everything.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The kind of car you drive says what kind of person you are.","translation":"نوع ماشینی که سوار می‌شوید می‌گوید چه جور آدمی هستید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001825616.mp3"},{"sentence":"The fact that she never apologized says a lot about (= shows very clearly ) what kind of person she is.","translation":"این واقعیت که او هرگز عذرخواهی نکرد، چیزهای زیادی را در مورد (= به وضوح نشان می دهد) که او چگونه است، می گوید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001793161.mp3"},{"sentence":"It said a lot for the manager (= it showed that he is good ) that the team remained confident despite losing.","translation":"این خیلی برای مدیر گفت (= نشان داد که او خوب است) که تیم با وجود باخت، اعتماد به نفس خود را حفظ کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001793165.mp3"},{"sentence":"These results don’t say much for the quality of teaching (= they show that it is not very good ) .","translation":"این نتایج برای کیفیت تدریس چیز زیادی نمی گوید (= نشان می دهد که خیلی خوب نیست).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001793170.mp3"},{"sentence":"The look on her face said ‘I love you.’","translation":"قیافه اش گفت: \"دوستت دارم.\"","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001825620.mp3"},{"sentence":"His expression said it all.","translation":"قیافه اش گویای همه چیز بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001825623.mp3"}]'::jsonb,6),
('e2dd498c-1aba-5dcf-b56a-5beddd3f3ed4','3ec6f48a-767e-5468-8376-3849936c556b',6,'speak the words of something','سخنان چیزی را بگو','spoken & written','to speak the words that are written in a play, poem , or prayer','[ transitive ]',null,'برای گفتن کلماتی که در یک نمایشنامه، شعر یا دعا نوشته شده است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['say hello/goodbye I came to say goodbye.','say thank you I just wanted to say thank you for being there.','say sorry/say that you’re sorry It was probably too late to say sorry.','say yes/no Some parents are unable to say no to their children.','say something/anything/nothing I was about to say something to him when he looked up and smiled.','say some words She stopped abruptly, suddenly afraid to say the words aloud.','say so If you don’t know the answer, don’t be afraid to say so.','a terrible/stupid/odd etc thing to say I know it’s a terrible thing to say, but I wish he’d just go away.','have something/anything/nothing to say He usually has something to say about just about everything.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Can you say that line again, this time with more feeling?","translation":"آیا می توانید آن خط را دوباره بگویید، این بار با احساس بیشتر؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001825624.mp3"},{"sentence":"I’ll say a prayer for you.","translation":"برات دعا میکنم","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000715916.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('ac324939-8994-5ceb-a06f-a7d7363fe6df','3ec6f48a-767e-5468-8376-3849936c556b',7,'pronounce','تلفظ کنید','spoken & written','to pronounce a word or sound','[ transitive ]',null,'برای تلفظ یک کلمه یا صدا','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['say hello/goodbye I came to say goodbye.','say thank you I just wanted to say thank you for being there.','say sorry/say that you’re sorry It was probably too late to say sorry.','say yes/no Some parents are unable to say no to their children.','say something/anything/nothing I was about to say something to him when he looked up and smiled.','say some words She stopped abruptly, suddenly afraid to say the words aloud.','say so If you don’t know the answer, don’t be afraid to say so.','a terrible/stupid/odd etc thing to say I know it’s a terrible thing to say, but I wish he’d just go away.','have something/anything/nothing to say He usually has something to say about just about everything.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"How do you say your last name?","translation":"چگونه نام خانوادگی خود را بیان می کنید؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001793123.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('c28dd088-a281-5af3-bb4f-a96cc56a732f','3ec6f48a-767e-5468-8376-3849936c556b',8,'suggest/suppose something','چیزی را پیشنهاد/فرض کن','spoken & written','used when suggesting or supposing that something might happen or be true','[ transitive ]',null,'زمانی استفاده می شود که پیشنهاد می کنیم یا فرض می کنیم که ممکن است چیزی اتفاق بیفتد یا درست باشد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['say hello/goodbye I came to say goodbye.','say thank you I just wanted to say thank you for being there.','say sorry/say that you’re sorry It was probably too late to say sorry.','say yes/no Some parents are unable to say no to their children.','say something/anything/nothing I was about to say something to him when he looked up and smiled.','say some words She stopped abruptly, suddenly afraid to say the words aloud.','say so If you don’t know the answer, don’t be afraid to say so.','a terrible/stupid/odd etc thing to say I know it’s a terrible thing to say, but I wish he’d just go away.','have something/anything/nothing to say He usually has something to say about just about everything.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"If we put out, say, twenty chairs, would that be enough?","translation":"اگر مثلاً بیست صندلی بیرون بیاوریم، کافی است؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001793176.mp3"},{"sentence":"Let’s say your plan fails, then what?","translation":"بیایید بگوییم نقشه شما شکست می خورد، پس چه؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000716010.mp3"},{"sentence":"Just say you won the lottery – what would you do?","translation":"فقط بگویید در لاتاری برنده شدید - چه کار می کنید؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000716011.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
