('a6714903-a20c-5cd1-b9bc-b87cf7619d4f','6f3d5fa8-191e-5d8b-bcfc-9883a5b72b75',1,null,null,'spoken & written','the right to take part in deciding something',null,null,'حق شرکت در تصمیم گیری در مورد چیزی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The workers had no say in how the factory was run.","translation":"کارگران هیچ نظری در مورد نحوه اداره کارخانه نداشتند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001610262.mp3"},{"sentence":"The chairman has the final say (= has the right to make the final decision about something ) .","translation":"رئیس حرف آخر را می زند (= حق دارد در مورد چیزی تصمیم نهایی را بگیرد).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001610266.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('cb086f2c-d3e4-52b1-af34-2716407e3fd6','6f3d5fa8-191e-5d8b-bcfc-9883a5b72b75',2,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'have your say',null,'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('98861e0b-8904-5f77-881d-972976879846','925d70fa-806a-5400-a6c1-26dbf27cba8e',1,null,null,'spoken & written','used to express surprise , or to get someone’s attention so that you can tell them something',null,null,'برای ابراز تعجب یا جلب توجه کسی استفاده می شود تا بتوانید چیزی به او بگویید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Say, haven’t I seen you before somewhere?","translation":"بگو آیا قبلاً تو را جایی ندیده ام؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000716904.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('3564cd4c-ddf8-526a-b2c5-e87a94b63b75','f85d91ed-6e39-57eb-809a-316c48f9b44f',1,null,null,'spoken & written','the large area of salty water that covers much of the Earth ’s surface','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'دریا، بحر؛ دریا (سطح)؛ دریای (بزرگ)',array['ocean']::text[],'{}'::text[],array['blue The sun shone brightly upon the clear blue sea.','calm The sea was perfectly calm.','rough (= with big waves ) The sea was too rough to swim in.','choppy (= with a lot of small waves ) The wind was starting to pick up and the sea was becoming choppy. The yachts bobbed around on the choppy sea.','heavy seas (= a rough sea ) The tanker split apart and sank in heavy seas.','a stormy sea a picture of a battleship in a stormy sea','the open sea (= the part of the sea that is far away from land ) Rescuers are trying to drive the stranded whales back out into the open sea.','the deep sea (= the water deep under the surface of the sea ) The deep sea is the most unexplored area left on the planet.','cross the sea Our ancestors crossed the sea in small boats.','go to sea (= go to work on a ship ) He went to sea when he was eighteen.','put to sea (= sail a boat away from land ) The refugees put to sea in rickety rafts.','be lost at sea formal (= be drowned in the sea ) His father had been lost at sea three months before.','be swept out to sea (= be taken far away from land by the sea ) They had to rescue three young canoeists who were swept out to sea.','sea water Removing salt from sea water is an expensive process.','a sea view All the bedrooms have a sea view.','sea level Average sea levels are rising year on year.','the sea air (= the air close to the sea ) He breathed in the fresh sea air.','the sea bed ( also the sea floor ) (= the land at the bottom of the sea ) A lot of these small creatures feed on the sea bed.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Jay stripped his clothes off and ran into the sea.","translation":"جی لباسش را درآورد و به سمت دریا دوید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000723372.mp3"},{"sentence":"The sea came up to my knees.","translation":"دریا تا زانوهایم آمد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce6exa_00765.mp3"},{"sentence":"Most exports went by sea (= on a ship ) .","translation":"بیشتر صادرات از طریق دریا (= با کشتی) انجام می شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000723380.mp3"},{"sentence":"a little cottage by the sea (= near the sea )","translation":"یک کلبه کوچک در کنار دریا (= نزدیک دریا)","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000723384.mp3"},{"sentence":"He spent over 30 years at sea (= working on ships or boats on the sea ) .","translation":"او بیش از 30 سال را در دریا گذراند (= کار بر روی کشتی یا قایق در دریا).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001581957.mp3"},{"sentence":"They stood side by side looking out to sea (= looking at the sea ) .","translation":"در کنار هم ایستادند و به دریا نگاه کردند (= به دریا نگاه کردند).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001581964.mp3"}]'::jsonb,6),
