('b85a1a78-5df5-5940-9a0b-4a547895cc25','9e839cc0-701b-55ab-a508-d5e16e975ea3',1,'put','قرار دادن','written','to carefully put something down somewhere','[ transitive always + adverb/preposition ]',null,'گذاشتن، قرار دادن (با دقت)؛ تنظیم کردن (تاریخ)؛ انداختن (حال)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"She set the tray down on a table next to his bed.","translation":"سینی را روی میزی کنار تختش گذاشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001793293.mp3"},{"sentence":"Mark filled the pan and set it on the stove.","translation":"مارک ظرف را پر کرد و روی اجاق گذاشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001793294.mp3"},{"sentence":"The workmen set the box down carefully on the floor.","translation":"کارگران جعبه را با احتیاط روی زمین گذاشتند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001793297.mp3"},{"sentence":"Remove the mushrooms and set them aside.","translation":"قارچ ها را بردارید و کنار بگذارید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001793298.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('c38e00e4-d6bb-577a-a84f-ac2d81789aaf','9e839cc0-701b-55ab-a508-d5e16e975ea3',2,'put into surface','به سطح گذاشته شود','spoken & written','to put something into a surface','[ transitive always + adverb/preposition ]',null,'گذاشتن چیزی در سطح','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Gates should be hung on sturdy posts set well into the ground.","translation":"دروازه‌ها را باید بر روی پایه‌های محکمی که به خوبی روی زمین قرار دارند آویزان کنید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001793304.mp3"},{"sentence":"an alarm button set into the wall beside the door","translation":"یک دکمه هشدار روی دیوار کنار در نصب شده است","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001793308.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('384a543a-27bf-5276-86a4-7611b256ca54','9e839cc0-701b-55ab-a508-d5e16e975ea3',3,'story','داستان','spoken & written','if a film, play, story etc is set in a particular place or period, the action takes place there or then','[ transitive always + adverb/preposition ]',null,'اگر فیلم، نمایشنامه، داستان و غیره در یک مکان یا دوره خاص اتفاق می‌افتد، اکشن در آنجا یا آن زمان اتفاق می‌افتد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The novel is set in France.","translation":"داستان این رمان در فرانسه می گذرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001793315.mp3"},{"sentence":"All this romance is set against a backdrop of rural Irish life.","translation":"همه این عاشقانه ها در پس زمینه ای از زندگی روستایی ایرلندی است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001793318.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('b50575fe-70d5-5574-9771-ce44b1f63b5d','9e839cc0-701b-55ab-a508-d5e16e975ea3',4,'consider','در نظر بگیرید','spoken & written','to consider something in relation to other things','[ transitive always + adverb/preposition ]',null,'در نظر گرفتن چیزی در رابطه با چیزهای دیگر','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"These casualty totals have to be set against the continuing growth in traffic.","translation":"این مجموع تلفات باید در مقابل رشد مداوم ترافیک تنظیم شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001793329.mp3"},{"sentence":"This debate should be set in an international context .","translation":"این بحث باید در زمینه بین المللی مطرح شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001793330.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('87e284db-1c80-517f-83d9-cd22763873d9','9e839cc0-701b-55ab-a508-d5e16e975ea3',5,'establish something','چیزی را تاسیس کن','spoken & written','to establish a way of doing something that is then copied or regarded as good','[ transitive ]',null,'ایجاد راهی برای انجام کاری که سپس کپی می شود یا خوب تلقی می شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['set an example (= behave well in a way that other people can copy ) Parents should try to set a good example to their teenagers.','set a precedent (= do something that later actions or decisions may be based on ) This legislation would set a most dangerous precedent.','set the pattern/trend (= do something in a way that is later repeated ) That first day seemed to set the pattern for the following weeks.','set the tone (= establish a general mood or feeling ) The gloomy first chapter sets the tone for the rest of the novel.','set the standard (= be very good, and so show how good other people or things should be ) They wanted to set the standard for software.','set the agenda (= establish what subjects should be discussed ) We are not attempting to set the agenda for other women’s groups.','set the pace (= move or change quickly, so that others try to do the same ) With regard to industrialization, Britain set the pace in the first half of the nineteenth century.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Art and literature flourished and this set the pattern for the whole of Europe.","translation":"هنر و ادبیات شکوفا شد و این الگوی کل اروپا شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001793341.mp3"},{"sentence":"The prime minister’s fierce speech set the tone for the rest of the conference.","translation":"سخنرانی تند نخست وزیر لحن بقیه کنفرانس را تعیین کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000704731.mp3"},{"sentence":"It is important that parents set an example (= behave well ) .","translation":"مهم است که والدین الگو قرار دهند (= رفتار خوبی داشته باشند).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001793342.mp3"},{"sentence":"The outcome of the case will set a legal precedent .","translation":"نتیجه این پرونده یک سابقه قانونی ایجاد می کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001793349.mp3"},{"sentence":"His photographs set the standard for landscapes.","translation":"عکس های او معیاری برای مناظر است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001793355.mp3"},{"sentence":"Freud’s views on sexuality set the agenda for much of the century (= people paid attention to the subjects he dealt with ) .","translation":"دیدگاه‌های فروید در مورد تمایلات جنسی، دستور کار بسیاری از قرن را تنظیم کرد (= مردم به موضوعاتی که او با آنها سر و کار داشت توجه کردند).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001793359.mp3"}]'::jsonb,6),
('014946c2-f3ec-54ea-8720-b0e10c5ddf2b','9e839cc0-701b-55ab-a508-d5e16e975ea3',6,'start something happening','شروع کردن چیزی','spoken & written','to make something start happening or to make someone start doing something','[ transitive ]',null,'کاری کردن که چیزی شروع شود یا کسی را وادار به انجام کاری کنیم','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"A study by military experts was immediately set in motion.","translation":"یک مطالعه توسط کارشناسان نظامی بلافاصله آغاز شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001793372.mp3"},{"sentence":"The chief executive will set in train the process of finding a successor.","translation":"رئیس اجرایی روند یافتن جانشین را آموزش خواهد داد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001793373.mp3"},{"sentence":"Protesters set fire to two buses.","translation":"معترضان دو اتوبوس را به آتش کشیدند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa020223.mp3"},{"sentence":"Her last remark has set me thinking.","translation":"آخرین اظهارات او مرا به فکر فرو برد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001793387.mp3"},{"sentence":"The wind set the trees rustling.","translation":"باد درختان را خش خش می کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001793388.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
