('68059d2f-bc7c-526a-8d8e-6b0a3539b47c','2aa879ce-5e4d-557a-8076-ae888417e508',1,'hit lightly','ضربه ملایم','spoken & written','to hit your fingers lightly on something, for example to get someone’s attention','[ intransitive, transitive ]',null,'به آرامی انگشتان خود را به چیزی بزنید، به عنوان مثال برای جلب توجه کسی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"He turned as someone tapped him on the shoulder.","translation":"وقتی کسی روی شانه اش زد، برگشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000581454.mp3"},{"sentence":"I went up and tapped on the window.","translation":"رفتم بالا و ضربه ای به پنجره زدم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000581451.mp3"},{"sentence":"Mark tapped his fingers on the tabletop impatiently.","translation":"مارک با بی حوصلگی انگشتانش را روی میز می زد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001615956.mp3"},{"sentence":"She tapped ash from her cigarette.","translation":"خاکستر سیگارش را زد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001615957.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('4105ef9c-f29d-5b4c-b410-7f2029cbc658','2aa879ce-5e4d-557a-8076-ae888417e508',2,'music','موسیقی','spoken & written','to make a regular pattern of sounds with your fingers or feet, especially when you are listening to music','[ transitive ]',null,'برای ایجاد یک الگوی منظم از صداها با انگشتان یا پاها، به خصوص زمانی که به موسیقی گوش می دهید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"She tapped her feet in time to the music.","translation":"پاهایش را به موقع به موسیقی زد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001615965.mp3"},{"sentence":"a toe-tapping tune","translation":"یک آهنگ ضربه زدن به انگشتان پا","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001827624.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('b52c1310-77c2-517f-a25a-e22879bfe80f','2aa879ce-5e4d-557a-8076-ae888417e508',3,'energy/money','انرژی/پول','spoken & written','to use or take what is needed from something such as an energy supply or an amount of money','[ transitive ]',null,'برای استفاده یا گرفتن آنچه از چیزی مانند منبع انرژی یا مقداری پول مورد نیاز است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"People are tapping into the power supply illegally.","translation":"مردم به طور غیرقانونی از منبع برق استفاده می کنند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001615966.mp3"},{"sentence":"We hope that additional sources of funding can be tapped.","translation":"امیدواریم بتوانیم از منابع مالی بیشتری استفاده کنیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000581470.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('fcf19f34-4f71-5a52-b95e-3d66bf93f550','2aa879ce-5e4d-557a-8076-ae888417e508',4,'ideas','ایده ها','spoken & written','to make as much use as possible of the ideas, experience, knowledge etc that a group of people has','[ transitive ]',null,'تا حد امکان از ایده ها، تجربه، دانش و غیره که گروهی از افراد دارند استفاده کنند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Your adviser’s experience is there to be tapped.","translation":"تجربه مشاور شما در آنجا قابل استفاده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000581479.mp3"},{"sentence":"helping people tap into training opportunities","translation":"کمک به افراد برای استفاده از فرصت های آموزشی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001615967.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('4c6bed48-6f3f-5e6c-94d3-7ddb6262ed95','2aa879ce-5e4d-557a-8076-ae888417e508',5,'telephone','تلفن','spoken & written','to listen secretly to someone’s telephone by using a special piece of electronic equipment','[ transitive ]',null,'گوش دادن مخفیانه به تلفن شخصی با استفاده از یک قطعه خاص از تجهیزات الکترونیکی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Murray’s phone calls to Australia were tapped .","translation":"تماس های تلفنی موری با استرالیا شنود شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001615968.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('d2a490a4-b7bc-5c9d-91b0-aa3f4b19edbd','2aa879ce-5e4d-557a-8076-ae888417e508',6,'tree','درخت','spoken & written','to get liquid from the trunk of a tree by making a hole in it','[ transitive ]',null,'برای گرفتن مایع از تنه درخت با ایجاد سوراخ در آن','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('99d13768-b2fb-5be5-89f1-3aa0db111aa1','2aa879ce-5e4d-557a-8076-ae888417e508',7,'player','بازیکن','informal','if a football club taps a player from another team, it illegally tries to persuade that player to join its team','[ transitive ]',null,'اگر یک باشگاه فوتبال به بازیکنی از تیم دیگر ضربه بزند، به طور غیرقانونی سعی می کند آن بازیکن را متقاعد کند که به تیمش بپیوندد.','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('05e95bb1-5be9-54ec-a0b1-c5468de72d6c','f1bb4906-0fda-59a8-920c-441e973d47b5',1,null,null,'spoken & written','an amount of money that you must pay to the government according to your income , property , goods etc and that is used to pay for public services','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'مالیات، مالیه؛ مالیات (بر درآمد)؛ مالیه (فرد)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['pay tax Many people feel they are paying too much tax.','raise/increase taxes ( also put up taxes British English ) He claimed the Labour Party would put up taxes.','lower/cut/reduce taxes There’s no point promising to cut taxes if you can’t afford it.','high Higher taxes will slow down consumer spending.','low Republican voters say they want lower taxes and sensible spending cuts.','income tax (= tax paid on money that you earn ) The rich should pay more income tax.','sales tax (= a tax on things you buy ) We have to pay 15% sales tax on everything we buy.','inheritance tax (= tax paid on money, property etc that you receive from someone when they die ) Inheritance tax applies to the total value of the deceased’s assets.','a direct tax (= a tax on income ) The government’s revenue comes mainly from direct taxes.','an indirect tax (= a tax on things you buy ) The effect of indirect taxes is to raise the prices of goods.','a flat (rate) tax (= a tax that is the same for different people or things ) Corporate taxes are to be abolished and replaced by a flat rate tax.','the tax rate/the rate of tax The government reduced the basic rate of tax to 25p in the pound.','tax cuts He believes that big tax cuts will encourage economic growth.','tax increases He accused the president of planning the biggest tax increases in US history.','tax incentives (= lower taxes that encourage people to do something ) We have introduced new tax incentives for savings.','a tax allowance (= an amount you can earn without paying tax on it ) Cutting personal tax allowances penalizes the poor.','the tax burden (= the amount of tax paid ) The total tax burden has risen only slightly.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"a tax on fuel","translation":"مالیات بر سوخت","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000583278.mp3"},{"sentence":"He already pays 40% tax on his income.","translation":"او در حال حاضر 40 درصد مالیات بر درآمد خود می پردازد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001587346.mp3"},{"sentence":"profits before tax of £85.9m","translation":"سود قبل از مالیات 85.9 میلیون پوند","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000583282.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('fb502b7d-d2c5-588d-a8d2-c9c518c0fe90','0685addd-3484-5b86-a1ec-0acb6808661b',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to charge a tax on something',null,null,'برای چیزی مالیات گرفتن','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"They may be taxed at a higher rate.","translation":"آنها ممکن است با نرخ بالاتری مالیات بگیرند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001587368.mp3"},{"sentence":"The individual is taxed on the amount of dividend received.","translation":"بر میزان سود سهام دریافتی فرد مشمول مالیات می شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001587371.mp3"},{"sentence":"Cigarettes are heavily taxed in Britain.","translation":"سیگار در بریتانیا مالیات سنگینی دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000583324.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('f231020f-b54e-5ef1-a3b4-522e17faf9be','0685addd-3484-5b86-a1ec-0acb6808661b',2,null,null,'spoken & written','to pay the sum of money charged each year for using a vehicle on British roads',null,'car tax , road tax','برای پرداخت مبلغی که هر سال برای استفاده از وسیله نقلیه در جاده های بریتانیا دریافت می شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('152e3cb2-2a43-54d4-bd76-bf24abd0be37','0685addd-3484-5b86-a1ec-0acb6808661b',3,null,null,'spoken & written','to make someone have to work hard or make an effort',null,null,'برای اینکه کسی مجبور شود سخت کار کند یا تلاش کند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The kids are really taxing my patience today.","translation":"بچه ها امروز واقعاً از صبر من مالیات می گیرند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000583335.mp3"},{"sentence":"It shouldn’t tax your brain too much.","translation":"این نباید بیش از حد از مغز شما مالیات بگیرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001587381.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('c18c1607-ad86-5398-a0e1-ab0c3b0681e8','88e4bbb8-4312-546f-bee9-9ca20be971ac',1,'drink/leaves','نوشیدنی/برگ','spoken & written','a hot brown drink made by pouring boiling water onto the dried leaves from a particular Asian bush , or a cup of this drink','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'چای، چای (خوراک)؛ چای (شب)؛ چای (شکسته)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a cup/mug of tea Would you like a cup of tea?','a pot of tea Shall I make a pot of tea?','hot The tea was too hot to drink.','sweet I poured Helen a mug of sweet tea and waited for her to answer.','strong You''ve made the tea too strong.','weak You have your tea weak, don''t you Chris?','black (= without milk ) I ordered black tea and toast.','white (= with milk ) Two white teas and a coffee, please.','milky (= with a lot of milk ) I don''t like my tea so milky.','drink tea Susan sank into her chair and drank her tea.','pour tea She poured the tea and handed a cup to Cara.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Would you like a cup of tea or coffee?","translation":"آیا یک فنجان چای یا قهوه میل دارید؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001587439.mp3"},{"sentence":"Do you take milk and sugar in your tea?","translation":"آیا در چای خود شیر و شکر می خورید؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000583752.mp3"},{"sentence":"I’d like two teas and a piece of chocolate cake, please.","translation":"من دو چای و یک تکه کیک شکلاتی می خواهم، لطفا.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001587440.mp3"},{"sentence":"tea plantations","translation":"مزارع چای","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001587445.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
