('433ef6a1-74a9-527e-95b0-858e718a754c','88e4bbb8-4312-546f-bee9-9ca20be971ac',3,'meal','وعده غذایی','spoken & written','a small meal of cake or biscuit s eaten in the afternoon with a cup of tea','[ countable, uncountable ]','high tea','یک وعده غذایی کوچک از کیک یا بیسکویت بعد از ظهر با یک فنجان چای میل شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a cup/mug of tea Would you like a cup of tea?','a pot of tea Shall I make a pot of tea?','hot The tea was too hot to drink.','sweet I poured Helen a mug of sweet tea and waited for her to answer.','strong You''ve made the tea too strong.','weak You have your tea weak, don''t you Chris?','black (= without milk ) I ordered black tea and toast.','white (= with milk ) Two white teas and a coffee, please.','milky (= with a lot of milk ) I don''t like my tea so milky.','drink tea Susan sank into her chair and drank her tea.','pour tea She poured the tea and handed a cup to Cara.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"We serve lunch and afternoon tea .","translation":"ناهار و چای عصرانه سرو می کنیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001587446.mp3"},{"sentence":"We stopped for a cream tea on the way home (= tea and cream cakes ) .","translation":"در راه خانه برای خوردن چای خامه ای توقف کردیم (= چای و کیک خامه ای).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001587450.mp3"},{"sentence":"We had baked beans on toast for tea.","translation":"برای چای روی نان تست لوبیا پخته بودیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce6exa_00875.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
