('7e7cb3ec-268c-552f-9a87-beda04e32d81','9e078c1f-64ab-5cb4-aa3f-0579fd961d40',1,'method','روش','spoken & written','a method that you use to do or achieve something','[ countable ]',null,'راه، روش؛ مسیر (رفتن)؛ راه (سفر)؛ مسیر (فرد)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['the right way That’s not the right way to deal with the problem.','the wrong way There is a right way and a wrong way to do it.','a good way Parent and toddler groups are a good way to meet other mums.','the best way Doing the job is often regarded as the best way of learning the job.','a different way There are many different ways of borrowing money.','a sure way Improving your diet is the surest way to lower your risk of heart disease.','a quick way Wouldn’t just asking him be the quickest way to find out?','an easy way Here’s an easy way to cut up a mango.','have a way Do you have any way of finding out if that is true?','find a way We must find a way to help them.','think of/devise a way I have to think of a way to make some money.','ways and means We are discussing ways and means of bringing jobs to our area.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"There are several different ways we can tackle this problem.","translation":"راه های مختلفی وجود دارد که می توانیم با این مشکل مقابله کنیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000511091.mp3"},{"sentence":"Evening classes are one way of meeting new people.","translation":"کلاس های عصر یکی از راه های ملاقات با افراد جدید است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001801852.mp3"},{"sentence":"There’s no way of knowing if the treatment will work.","translation":"هیچ راهی برای دانستن اینکه آیا درمان موثر خواهد بود وجود ندارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001801853.mp3"},{"sentence":"What’s the best way to learn a language?","translation":"بهترین راه برای یادگیری زبان چیست؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001801858.mp3"},{"sentence":"Make the drink with boiling water in the same way as tea.","translation":"نوشیدنی را مانند چای با آب جوش درست کنید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001801861.mp3"},{"sentence":"Animals communicate in various ways.","translation":"حیوانات به روش های مختلف ارتباط برقرار می کنند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001801862.mp3"},{"sentence":"I think you’re going about this the wrong way .","translation":"من فکر می کنم که شما در مورد این راه اشتباه پیش می روید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000511102.mp3"},{"sentence":"There are ways and means of raising the money that we need.","translation":"راه ها و روش هایی برای جمع آوری پول مورد نیاز ما وجود دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001801871.mp3"},{"sentence":"One way around the problem (= method of dealing with it ) is recycling.","translation":"یک راه حل مشکل (= روش مقابله با آن) بازیافت است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001801874.mp3"},{"sentence":"There seems to be no way out of the current economic crisis.","translation":"به نظر می رسد هیچ راهی برای خروج از بحران اقتصادی فعلی وجود ندارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001801878.mp3"},{"sentence":"companies eager for a way into business in Europe","translation":"شرکت‌هایی که مشتاق راهی برای ورود به تجارت در اروپا هستند","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001801882.mp3"}]'::jsonb,11),
('7d027608-6016-5566-83da-4aef48e5f4d8','9e078c1f-64ab-5cb4-aa3f-0579fd961d40',2,'manner','روش','spoken & written','the manner or style in which someone does something or in which something happens','[ countable ]',null,'روش یا سبکی که در آن کسی کاری را انجام می دهد یا در آن چیزی اتفاق می افتد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Look at the way he’s dressed!","translation":"به طرز لباس پوشیدنش نگاه کن!","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000511146.mp3"},{"sentence":"‘Hello, ’ he said in a friendly way.","translation":"با حالتی دوستانه گفت: سلام.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001801886.mp3"},{"sentence":"Maria got up and took a shower in a leisurely way.","translation":"ماریا بلند شد و با آرامش دوش گرفت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001801887.mp3"},{"sentence":"I find it easier to work in this way (= like this ) .","translation":"به نظر من کار کردن به این شکل (= اینطور) راحت تر است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001801890.mp3"},{"sentence":"Sorry, I didn’t know you felt that way (= had that feeling or opinion ) .","translation":"متأسفم، نمی دانستم شما چنین احساسی دارید (= آن احساس یا نظر را داشتید).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001801894.mp3"},{"sentence":"The drugs didn’t seem to affect Anna in the same way .","translation":"به نظر نمی رسید که داروها بر آنا تأثیری مشابه داشته باشند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001801898.mp3"},{"sentence":"That’s no way to speak to your father!","translation":"این راهی نیست که با پدرت صحبت کنی!","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001801905.mp3"},{"sentence":"The changes will benefit the company in more ways than one.","translation":"این تغییرات از یک جهت به نفع شرکت خواهد بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000511152.mp3"},{"sentence":"I’m sure he does love you, in his own way.","translation":"من مطمئن هستم که او شما را به روش خودش دوست دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001801909.mp3"}]'::jsonb,9),
('dc150665-ce80-5c09-873f-7d5aa11d7c57','9e078c1f-64ab-5cb4-aa3f-0579fd961d40',3,'direction/how to go somewhere','جهت/چگونه به جایی برویم','spoken & written','a road, path, direction etc that you take in order to get to a particular place','[ countable ]',null,'یک جاده، مسیر، مسیر و غیره که شما برای رسیدن به یک مکان خاص انتخاب می کنید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Which is the quickest way to the sea from here?","translation":"سریعترین راه از اینجا به دریا کدام است؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000511167.mp3"},{"sentence":"There are several ways through the woods.","translation":"چندین راه از طریق جنگل وجود دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001801918.mp3"},{"sentence":"Could you tell me the way to the station?","translation":"ممکن است راه ایستگاه را به من بگویید؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001801921.mp3"},{"sentence":"Does anyone know the way from here?","translation":"کسی راه را از اینجا می داند؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001801922.mp3"},{"sentence":"I was afraid of losing my way in the dark.","translation":"می ترسیدم راهم را در تاریکی گم کنم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001801926.mp3"},{"sentence":"Can you find your way back to the car park?","translation":"آیا می توانید راه بازگشت به پارکینگ را پیدا کنید؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001801932.mp3"},{"sentence":"Which is the way out?","translation":"راه خروج کدام است؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001801941.mp3"},{"sentence":"She looked all around, but she couldn’t seem to find the way in.","translation":"او همه جا را نگاه کرد، اما به نظر نمی رسید که راهی برای ورود پیدا کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001801945.mp3"},{"sentence":"Want a lift? It’s on my way.","translation":"آسانسور می خواهید؟ در راه است","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001801949.mp3"},{"sentence":"I live miles out of your way.","translation":"من کیلومترها دورتر از تو زندگی میکنم","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001801953.mp3"},{"sentence":"Which way is north?","translation":"کدام سمت شمال است؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001801956.mp3"},{"sentence":"Walk this way .","translation":"این طرف راه برو","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001801959.mp3"},{"sentence":"A big Mercedes was coming the other way (= from the opposite direction ) .","translation":"یک مرسدس بزرگ از طرف دیگر (= از طرف مقابل) می آمد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001801963.mp3"},{"sentence":"He left the house, looking carefully both ways.","translation":"از خانه بیرون رفت و هر دو طرف را با دقت نگاه کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001801968.mp3"}]'::jsonb,14),
('599124c3-f6da-5abe-974f-4d6285b3ccbb','9e078c1f-64ab-5cb4-aa3f-0579fd961d40',4,'part of something that is true','بخشی از چیزی که حقیقت دارد','spoken & written','used to say that there is a fact or a feature of something that makes a statement or description true','[ countable ]',null,'معمولاً می‌گفتند که یک واقعیت یا ویژگی چیزی وجود دارد که یک گزاره یا توصیف را درست می‌کند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"In one way you’re right, I suppose.","translation":"از یک جهت حق با شماست، گمان می کنم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001801977.mp3"},{"sentence":"Working at home makes sense, in many ways.","translation":"کار در خانه از بسیاری جهات منطقی است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001801980.mp3"},{"sentence":"Ben is a perfectly normal child in every way .","translation":"بن از هر نظر یک کودک کاملاً عادی است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001801981.mp3"},{"sentence":"He never got mad at me. He was great in that way .","translation":"او هرگز از من عصبانی نشد. او از این نظر عالی بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001801985.mp3"},{"sentence":"This should in no way be seen as a defeat.","translation":"این به هیچ وجه نباید به عنوان یک شکست تلقی شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001801992.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('49337a8d-766d-53b7-80a5-ef7984465cc5','9e078c1f-64ab-5cb4-aa3f-0579fd961d40',5,'distance/time','فاصله/زمان','spoken & written','a distance or a length of time, especially a long one','[ singular ]',null,'یک مسافت یا یک مدت زمان، به خصوص طولانی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"I was still a long way from home.","translation":"هنوز خیلی از خانه فاصله داشتم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001801994.mp3"},{"sentence":"She had to park some way from the restaurant.","translation":"مجبور شد مقداری از رستوران پارک کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001802001.mp3"},{"sentence":"A peace settlement now seems a long way off.","translation":"به نظر می رسد اکنون راه حلی برای صلح بسیار دور است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001802005.mp3"},{"sentence":"I don’t want to go all that way and not see him.","translation":"من نمی خواهم این همه راه را بروم و او را نبینم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001802006.mp3"},{"sentence":"Did you really swim all the way across?","translation":"آیا واقعاً تمام مسیر را شنا کردید؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000511220.mp3"},{"sentence":"I was awake all through the night.","translation":"تمام شب بیدار بودم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001802010.mp3"},{"sentence":"That’s quite a ways from here, isn’t it?","translation":"این یک راه کاملاً از اینجاست، اینطور نیست؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000511210.mp3"}]'::jsonb,7),
('34167407-596f-51e5-b82d-655270a785e2','9e078c1f-64ab-5cb4-aa3f-0579fd961d40',6,'the space in front of you','فضای روبروی شما','spoken & written','if someone or something is in the way, they are blocking the space in front of you, and you cannot move forward','[ countable usually singular ]',null,'اگر کسی یا چیزی در راه باشد، فضای جلوی شما را مسدود می کند و شما نمی توانید جلو بروید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"There was a big truck in the way.","translation":"یک کامیون بزرگ سر راه بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001802025.mp3"},{"sentence":"Sorry, am I in your way?","translation":"ببخشید من سر راه شما هستم؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001802026.mp3"},{"sentence":"A policeman yelled at the crowds to get out of the way .","translation":"یک پلیس سر جمعیت فریاد زد تا از سر راه بروند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001802027.mp3"},{"sentence":"The way ahead was blocked.","translation":"راه پیش رو بسته بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001802031.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
