('70c4ccf2-479e-51e7-a862-659d9306113d','c20612dd-601c-593d-bd32-cafd2e8f3931',1,'competition/race','مسابقه/مسابقه','spoken & written','to be the best or most successful in a competition , game , election etc','[ intransitive, transitive ]',null,'بردن، برنده شدن (مسابقه)؛ گرفتن (قلب)؛ به دست آوردن (پول)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['win a race He should have won that race but he came third.','win a game/match It’s supposed to be easier to win your home games.','win a competition The competition was won by a team from Surrey.','win an election Which party is likely to win the election?','win a battle/war Who won the battle of Waterloo?','win a victory The protesters have won one victory already.','easily Chavez won the election easily.','comfortably (= by a large amount, so that you do not have to worry about winning ) The Celtics won comfortably, with a 22-point lead.','convincingly (= by a large amount ) United won convincingly by three goals to nil.','outright (= clearly and completely ) If one candidate gets more than 50 percent of the vote, he will win the seat outright.','narrowly (= by only a small amount ) In 1916 he narrowly won re-election.','hands down (= very easily or by a large amount ) Everyone expected Sam to win hands down.','win by 10 points/ten metres etc We won by 23 points.','a winning streak (= when you win many competitions one after another ) They came here with a four-game winning streak.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Who do you think will win the next election?","translation":"به نظر شما چه کسی در انتخابات بعدی پیروز خواهد شد؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000488116.mp3"},{"sentence":"He won the Tour de France last year.","translation":"او سال گذشته قهرمان تور دو فرانس شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001740637.mp3"},{"sentence":"the young pilots who won the Battle of Britain","translation":"خلبانان جوانی که در نبرد بریتانیا پیروز شدند","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001740640.mp3"},{"sentence":"Who’s winning (= who is most successful at this point in the game ) ?","translation":"چه کسی برنده است (= چه کسی در این مرحله از بازی موفق تر است)؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001740641.mp3"},{"sentence":"I never win at cards.","translation":"من هرگز در کارت برنده نمی شوم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000488119.mp3"},{"sentence":"We won by just one point.","translation":"ما فقط یک امتیاز بردیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000488122.mp3"}]'::jsonb,6),
