('b1537153-e128-5fd5-913d-76793405336b','a6269902-3a78-5a4a-aec9-c1cb7656ed8f',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a particular part of a country, town etc',null,null,'ناحیه، منطقه، محدوده؛ رشته، زمینه','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a rural area (= in the countryside ) Schools in rural areas are often very small.','an urban area (= in a town or city ) 90% of the English population live in urban areas.','a remote/isolated area (= a long way from towns and cities ) a remote area of northeast Afghanistan','the local area He quickly made friends in the local area.','the surrounding area (= the area around a place ) The tourist office will have a map of the surrounding area.','outlying areas (= far from the centre of a town, village etc ) The programme also includes plans to reforest outlying areas of the city.','a wooded area The plane crashed into trees in a heavily wooded area.','a mountainous area the mountainous areas of the Massif Central','a coastal area The bird is found mainly in coastal areas.','a desert area The hot, dry wind blows in from the desert areas of North Africa.','a residential area (= a part of a town where people live ) They had a large house in a pleasant residential area.','an industrial area People living in industrial areas are exposed to these types of chemicals.','a built-up area (= with a lot of buildings close together ) New development will not be allowed outside the existing built-up area.','a deprived area (= where many poor people live ) He grew up in one of the toughest and most deprived areas of Glasgow.','an inner-city area (= the central part of a city, where many poor people live ) When will something be done to improve our inner-city areas?','a middle-class/working-class etc area (= where a particular class of people live ) She was born in a working-class area of London.','a metropolitan area (= a very large city ) major metropolitan areas such as Delhi, Bombay, and Calcutta','a conservation area (= for preserving nature or old buildings ) a new scheme to create a nature conservation area','a geographical area (= one that is shown on a map ) The survey took place in three geographical areas.','move into/out of an area She had just moved into the area and knew very few people. Many young people are moving out of rural areas.','keep/stay away from an area The police ordered people to stay away from the area.','be spread out over a wide area The town is spread out over a wide area.','be scattered over a wide area Parts of the plane were scattered over a wide area.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Only cheeses made in this area may be labelled ‘Roquefort’.","translation":"فقط پنیرهایی که در این منطقه تولید می شوند ممکن است دارای برچسب \"روکوفور\" باشند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001676380.mp3"},{"sentence":"Crime rates are much higher in urban areas.","translation":"نرخ جرم و جنایت در مناطق شهری بسیار بالاتر است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa000091.mp3"},{"sentence":"Many areas of Africa have suffered severe drought this year.","translation":"بسیاری از مناطق آفریقا امسال دچار خشکسالی شدید شده اند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000948507.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('11e7af50-17b1-5c94-8b52-35699334e902','a6269902-3a78-5a4a-aec9-c1cb7656ed8f',2,null,null,'spoken & written','a part of a house, office, garden etc that is used for a particular purpose',null,null,'بخشی از یک خانه، دفتر، باغ و غیره که برای هدف خاصی استفاده می شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"a no-smoking area","translation":"یک منطقه ممنوعه سیگار","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001585917.mp3"},{"sentence":"Their apartment has a large kitchen area .","translation":"آپارتمان آنها دارای یک آشپزخانه بزرگ است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001676411.mp3"},{"sentence":"Come through into the dining area .","translation":"وارد قسمت غذاخوری شوید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000948516.mp3"},{"sentence":"the reception area of the hotel","translation":"قسمت پذیرش هتل","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001676418.mp3"},{"sentence":"a storage area on the ground floor","translation":"انباری در طبقه همکف","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001676422.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('d48e3ac8-4f53-5c41-bc30-81e300216e1d','a6269902-3a78-5a4a-aec9-c1cb7656ed8f',3,null,null,'spoken & written','a particular subject, range of activities, or group of related subjects',null,null,'یک موضوع خاص، طیف وسیعی از فعالیت ها، یا گروهی از موضوعات مرتبط','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The course covers three main subject areas .","translation":"این دوره سه حوزه موضوعی اصلی را پوشش می دهد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001676426.mp3"},{"sentence":"This study has clearly identified a major problem area for the National Health Service.","translation":"این مطالعه به وضوح یک منطقه مشکل اصلی را برای خدمات بهداشت ملی شناسایی کرده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001676430.mp3"},{"sentence":"We’re funding research into new areas such as law enforcement technology.","translation":"ما در حال تأمین بودجه تحقیقات در زمینه های جدید مانند فناوری اجرای قانون هستیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001676434.mp3"},{"sentence":"reforms in the key areas of health and education","translation":"اصلاحات در حوزه های کلیدی بهداشت و آموزش","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000948522.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('adf1cf70-5728-5402-a412-906f45ba3bd2','a6269902-3a78-5a4a-aec9-c1cb7656ed8f',4,null,null,'spoken & written','the amount of space that a flat surface or shape covers',null,null,'مقدار فضایی که یک سطح یا شکل صاف می پوشاند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"an area of 2,000 square miles","translation":"مساحت 2000 مایل مربع","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000948527.mp3"},{"sentence":"a formula to calculate the area of a circle","translation":"فرمولی برای محاسبه مساحت دایره","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000948526.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('44399820-05f1-5250-b7cb-2103ad583919','c636403e-74df-51c3-b062-169775721f9e',1,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'the army','ارتش، ارگان نظامی؛ انبوه (افراد)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['join the army At 18, I decided to join the army.','go into the army When Dan left school, he went into the army.','serve in the army He had served in the Indian army.','leave the army Why did you leave the army?','be discharged/dismissed from the army He developed epilepsy, a condition which led to him being discharged from the army.','the British/French/Polish etc army a soldier in the Spanish army','a regular/standing army (= permanent and existing whether there is a war or not ) The regular army has about 5,000 troops.','an invading army The towns were looted by the invading army.','an occupying army (= one that is in a foreign country which they control by force ) There was constant resistance to the occupying army.','a victorious army Two days later, the victorious German army entered Paris.','a defeated army The survivors of his defeated army settled in Provence.','an advancing army (= moving forward in order to attack ) The advancing Roman army was almost upon them.','a retreating army (= moving away after being defeated ) Washington’s troops pursued the retreating British army.','an army base/camp the local army base','an army unit The town was surrounded by army units.','an army officer Both daughters married army officers.','an army recruit The army recruits must undergo basic training.','be in command of the army He had gained respect and was placed in command of the army.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
