('32e2acd6-67ef-592b-a002-5dee803c846b','362ac567-6807-5c80-84bf-c0890d84f7ae',7,'responsibility','مسئولیت','spoken & written','something special that someone has developed or is responsible for',null,null,'چیزی خاص که کسی توسعه داده یا مسئول آن است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a baby is born Let me know as soon as the baby is born.','have a baby/give birth to a baby She had the baby at home. Sue gave birth to a baby boy.','be expecting a baby (= be pregnant ) My wife’s expecting a baby.','a baby is due (= is expected to be born ) When is your baby due?','lose a baby (= have a baby that dies when it is born too soon ) She was three months pregnant when she lost the baby.','deliver a baby (= help a woman to give birth to a baby ) Usually your baby will be delivered by a midwife.','abandon a baby (= leave your baby somewhere because you do not want it ) A disturbing number of babies are abandoned by their mothers.','feed a baby If your baby cries, she may want feeding.','breast-feed a baby 63% of new mothers breast-feed their babies.','change a baby (= change its nappy ) Could you change the baby for me?','a newborn baby There’s plenty of help and advice for people with newborn babies.','an unborn baby (= not yet born ) Drinking alcohol is bad for your unborn baby.','a premature baby (= born before the normal time ) Lesley’s baby was three weeks premature.','an abandoned baby (= left somewhere by a mother who does not want it ) The abandoned baby was found under a hedge.','an illegitimate baby (= born to an unmarried mother ) The number of illegitimate babies is rising.','an unwanted baby Unwanted babies were frequently abandoned in the streets.','a contented baby Danielle was a lovely contented baby.','a baby boy/girl She’s just had a lovely healthy baby girl.','a baby son/daughter/brother/sister We’d like a baby brother or sister for Ben.','baby clothes/food']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Don’t ask me about the building contract – that’s Robert’s baby.","translation":"از من در مورد قرارداد ساختمان نپرسید - این بچه رابرت است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000998341.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('e321574e-b94b-511a-a8d4-73ae1db8232b','362ac567-6807-5c80-84bf-c0890d84f7ae',8,'thing','چیز','informal','something, especially a piece of equipment or a machine , that you care about a lot',null,null,'چیزی، به خصوص یک قطعه تجهیزات یا یک ماشین، که شما به آن اهمیت زیادی می دهید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a baby is born Let me know as soon as the baby is born.','have a baby/give birth to a baby She had the baby at home. Sue gave birth to a baby boy.','be expecting a baby (= be pregnant ) My wife’s expecting a baby.','a baby is due (= is expected to be born ) When is your baby due?','lose a baby (= have a baby that dies when it is born too soon ) She was three months pregnant when she lost the baby.','deliver a baby (= help a woman to give birth to a baby ) Usually your baby will be delivered by a midwife.','abandon a baby (= leave your baby somewhere because you do not want it ) A disturbing number of babies are abandoned by their mothers.','feed a baby If your baby cries, she may want feeding.','breast-feed a baby 63% of new mothers breast-feed their babies.','change a baby (= change its nappy ) Could you change the baby for me?','a newborn baby There’s plenty of help and advice for people with newborn babies.','an unborn baby (= not yet born ) Drinking alcohol is bad for your unborn baby.','a premature baby (= born before the normal time ) Lesley’s baby was three weeks premature.','an abandoned baby (= left somewhere by a mother who does not want it ) The abandoned baby was found under a hedge.','an illegitimate baby (= born to an unmarried mother ) The number of illegitimate babies is rising.','an unwanted baby Unwanted babies were frequently abandoned in the streets.','a contented baby Danielle was a lovely contented baby.','a baby boy/girl She’s just had a lovely healthy baby girl.','a baby son/daughter/brother/sister We’d like a baby brother or sister for Ben.','baby clothes/food']::text[],'[{"sentence":"This baby can reach speeds of 130 miles per hour.","translation":"این نوزاد می تواند به سرعت 130 مایل در ساعت برسد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001644676.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('515fd287-359f-5790-9848-b2f77377eaff','0dafd774-2136-5030-8a89-6d7be37a081e',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to be too kind to someone and look after them as if they were a baby',null,null,'بیش از حد با کسی مهربان باشیم و طوری از او مراقبت کنیم که انگار بچه هستند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('b105578d-cf0f-5d05-affc-68d6ea27dc19','41aabd57-78b9-577f-89b7-353b3f1369f9',1,'return to place','بازگشت به محل','spoken & written','in, into, or to the place or position where someone or something was before',null,null,'به عقب، برگشته (به مکان یا حالت قبلی)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"I’ll be back in a minute.","translation":"من یک دقیقه دیگر برمی گردم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001781902.mp3"},{"sentence":"Put that book back where you found it!","translation":"آن کتاب را در جایی که پیدا کردی برگردان!","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000998510.mp3"},{"sentence":"Rory plugged the cable back into the socket.","translation":"روری کابل را دوباره به پریز وصل کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001781905.mp3"},{"sentence":"I feel like going back to bed.","translation":"دلم می خواهد به رختخواب برگردم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001781906.mp3"},{"sentence":"We ought to try and get back before it gets dark.","translation":"ما باید سعی کنیم قبل از تاریک شدن هوا برگردیم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001781909.mp3"},{"sentence":"He was back home by half past eleven.","translation":"ساعت یازده و نیم به خانه برگشته بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001781910.mp3"},{"sentence":"It’s possible to travel there and back in a day.","translation":"امکان سفر به آنجا و بازگشت در یک روز وجود دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001781914.mp3"},{"sentence":"We decided to go back to Athens.","translation":"تصمیم گرفتیم به آتن برگردیم.","audio_url":null},{"sentence":"I’m going back to school tomorrow.","translation":"فردا برمیگردم مدرسه","audio_url":null},{"sentence":"It’s time to go back home.","translation":"زمان بازگشت به خانه است.","audio_url":null}]'::jsonb,10),
('f32bb6a9-4e63-59d7-91d6-598673002003','41aabd57-78b9-577f-89b7-353b3f1369f9',2,'as before','مثل قبل','spoken & written','in or into the condition or situation you were in before',null,null,'در شرایط یا موقعیتی که قبلا در آن بودید یا در آن قرار بگیرید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Gary woke at 4 am and couldn’t get back to sleep.","translation":"گری ساعت 4 صبح از خواب بیدار شد و نتوانست دوباره بخوابد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000998522.mp3"},{"sentence":"It took me a long time to get my confidence back.","translation":"مدت زیادی طول کشید تا اعتماد به نفسم را برگردانم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001781919.mp3"},{"sentence":"If you decide to marry him, there will be no going back (= you will not be able to get back to your previous situation ) .","translation":"اگر تصمیم به ازدواج با او داشته باشید، دیگر بازگشتی وجود نخواهد داشت (= نمی توانید به وضعیت قبلی خود بازگردید).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001781920.mp3"},{"sentence":"There’s no way I’m going back to being poor.","translation":"هیچ راهی نیست که به فقیر بودن برگردم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001781927.mp3"},{"sentence":"It’ll take a while for things to get back to normal.","translation":"مدتی طول می کشد تا همه چیز به حالت عادی بازگردد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001781928.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('dc0a97c6-d48a-51c4-8f3b-c7edc8402370','41aabd57-78b9-577f-89b7-353b3f1369f9',3,'previous place','مکان قبلی','spoken & written','in or to a place where you lived or worked before',null,null,'در یا مکانی که قبلاً در آن زندگی یا کار کرده اید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"She was the one who had fired him from his first job back in South Africa.","translation":"او کسی بود که او را از اولین کارش در آفریقای جنوبی اخراج کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000998532.mp3"},{"sentence":"It reminded me of evenings back home.","translation":"من را به یاد عصرهای بازگشت به خانه می انداخت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001781933.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('32ba1880-245a-5bc1-ae3e-af62ccdd0bd7','41aabd57-78b9-577f-89b7-353b3f1369f9',4,'backwards','به عقب','spoken & written','in the opposite direction from the way you are facing',null,null,'در جهت مخالف مسیری که روبه رو هستید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"He glanced back at the house.","translation":"نگاهی به خانه انداخت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000998538.mp3"},{"sentence":"Kirov stepped back a pace.","translation":"کیروف کمی عقب تر رفت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000998539.mp3"},{"sentence":"She tilted her head back to look at him.","translation":"سرش را به عقب خم کرد تا به او نگاه کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001781935.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('8862e37e-bbe0-5003-b33e-649af103217f','41aabd57-78b9-577f-89b7-353b3f1369f9',5,'reply/reaction','پاسخ/واکنش','spoken & written','if you do something back, you do it as a reply or reaction to what someone has said or done',null,null,'اگر کاری را انجام دهید، آن را به عنوان پاسخ یا واکنش به آنچه که کسی گفته یا انجام داده است انجام می دهید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Can I call you back later?","translation":"آیا می توانم بعداً با شما تماس بگیرم؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000998545.mp3"},{"sentence":"I’ll pay you back on Friday.","translation":"من روز جمعه پول شما را پس می دهم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000374691.mp3"},{"sentence":"‘No, thanks!’ he shouted back.","translation":"جواب داد: نه، ممنون!","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000998547.mp3"},{"sentence":"If he hits you, you just hit him back.","translation":"اگر او به شما ضربه زد، شما فقط به او ضربه بزنید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001781937.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('92d842f2-57d5-59a1-a1cf-8ec2346cf9fd','41aabd57-78b9-577f-89b7-353b3f1369f9',6,'return something to somebody','چیزی را به کسی برگردان','spoken & written','if you give something, get something etc back, you return it to the person who first had it, or you have it returned to you',null,null,'اگر چیزی را بدهید، چیزی و غیره را پس بگیرید، آن را به کسی که اولین بار آن را داشته است برمی گردانید یا به شما بازگردانده می شود.','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Can we have our ball back, please?","translation":"آیا می توانیم توپمان را پس بگیریم، لطفا؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001781942.mp3"},{"sentence":"I want all my books back as soon as you’ve finished with them.","translation":"من می‌خواهم همه کتاب‌هایم را به محض اینکه با آنها تمام شد، برگردانم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001781943.mp3"},{"sentence":"Give me back that letter! It’s none of your business!","translation":"آن نامه را به من پس بده! به تو مربوط نیست!","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001781944.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('84df0893-6caa-5d59-a0cd-516f3862fc86','41aabd57-78b9-577f-89b7-353b3f1369f9',7,'in the past','در گذشته','spoken & written','in or towards a time in the past',null,null,'در یا به سمت زمانی در گذشته','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"a pile of newspapers dating back to the 1970s","translation":"انبوهی از روزنامه های مربوط به دهه 1970","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001781946.mp3"},{"sentence":"A lot of emotional problems can be traced back to childhood.","translation":"بسیاری از مشکلات عاطفی را می توان به دوران کودکی ردیابی کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001781947.mp3"},{"sentence":"Looking back on it, I should have known he was unhappy.","translation":"با نگاهی به گذشته، باید می دانستم که او ناراضی است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001781948.mp3"},{"sentence":"At times, I think back to my life in Moscow.","translation":"گاهی به زندگی خود در مسکو فکر می کنم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001781949.mp3"},{"sentence":"The house was built back in 1235.","translation":"این خانه در سال 1235 ساخته شده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000998567.mp3"},{"sentence":"His wife died a couple of years back.","translation":"همسرش چند سال پیش فوت کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000998571.mp3"},{"sentence":"He called me a while back .","translation":"چند وقت پیش با من تماس گرفت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001781950.mp3"}]'::jsonb,7),
('374fb682-9114-5c23-bf87-109f90a35940','41aabd57-78b9-577f-89b7-353b3f1369f9',8,'again','دوباره','spoken & written','once again',null,null,'یک بار دیگر','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Go back over your work to check for any mistakes.","translation":"برای بررسی هر گونه اشتباه به کار خود برگردید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000998554.mp3"},{"sentence":"Liverpool were back level again two minutes later with a superb goal.","translation":"لیورپول دو دقیقه بعد با یک گل عالی دوباره به تساوی رسید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001781955.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('974f6378-09b2-592f-b888-a610e3bde2a8','41aabd57-78b9-577f-89b7-353b3f1369f9',9,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'sit/lie/lean back','به عقب، برگشته (به مکان یا حالت قبلی)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('de7b4d37-c1ab-5a74-b332-67bed50fa52e','41aabd57-78b9-577f-89b7-353b3f1369f9',10,'away','دور','spoken & written','away from a surface, person, or thing',null,null,'دور از یک سطح، شخص یا چیز','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"She pulled the bandage back very carefully.","translation":"او باند را با دقت به عقب کشید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000998583.mp3"},{"sentence":"Her hair was brushed back from her face.","translation":"موهایش از روی صورتش جمع شده بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001781957.mp3"},{"sentence":"The woman nodded and stood back, allowing Patrick to enter.","translation":"زن سری تکان داد و عقب ایستاد و به پاتریک اجازه داد وارد شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001781958.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('72ea1e44-47dc-5259-9b18-f54bb220d47c','41aabd57-78b9-577f-89b7-353b3f1369f9',11,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'back and forth','به عقب، برگشته (به مکان یا حالت قبلی)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('838f914e-f8e0-512a-bb63-acd876e80df3','41aabd57-78b9-577f-89b7-353b3f1369f9',12,'towards beginning','به سمت شروع','spoken & written','towards the beginning of a book, film, or computer document etc',null,null,'در ابتدای یک کتاب، فیلم، یا سند کامپیوتری و غیره','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Turn back to the summaries at the end of section 1.5.","translation":"به خلاصه ها در پایان بخش 1.5 برگردید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001781960.mp3"},{"sentence":"Clicking on the icon will take you back to the previous web page.","translation":"با کلیک بر روی آیکون به صفحه وب قبلی باز می گردید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001781961.mp3"},{"sentence":"Wind the tape back to the beginning.","translation":"نوار را به اول برگردانید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000998596.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('097de43e-7f8e-5f74-b4ca-c8a298d4e6f5','76363add-1e8b-56ff-a714-1cf7d61cd6d6',1,'part of your body','بخشی از بدن شما','spoken & written','the part of the body between the neck and legs, on the opposite side to the stomach and chest',null,null,'پشت، قسمت پشتی بدن؛ پشت (چیز)',array['spine']::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The cat arched its back and hissed.","translation":"گربه پشتش را قوس داد و خش خش کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000998623.mp3"},{"sentence":"My feet were sore and my back was aching.","translation":"پاهایم درد می کرد و کمرم درد می کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001781964.mp3"},{"sentence":"Keep your head up and your back straight.","translation":"سر خود را بالا و پشت خود را صاف نگه دارید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001781965.mp3"},{"sentence":"To avoid back problems, always bend your knees when you lift heavy objects.","translation":"برای جلوگیری از مشکلات کمر، همیشه هنگام بلند کردن اجسام سنگین زانوهای خود را خم کنید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001781966.mp3"},{"sentence":"He lay on his back and gazed at the ceiling.","translation":"به پشت دراز کشید و به سقف خیره شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001781967.mp3"},{"sentence":"Johnny was lying flat on his back in the middle of the floor.","translation":"جانی به پشت وسط زمین دراز کشیده بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001781973.mp3"},{"sentence":"Anna stood with her back to the window.","translation":"آنا پشت به پنجره ایستاد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001781979.mp3"},{"sentence":"The girl appeared again, now with a little baby on her back.","translation":"دختر دوباره ظاهر شد، حالا با یک بچه کوچک بر پشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001781988.mp3"},{"sentence":"He broke his back in a motorbike accident.","translation":"در تصادف با موتور کمرش شکست.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000998638.mp3"}]'::jsonb,9),
