ountry ) The Bundesbank is the central bank of Germany.','the World Bank (= an international organization providing financial help to developing countries ) The road building was funded by the World Bank.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('0969f6e9-ebfe-5644-a9e6-8da1c56e4536','e1af40e3-3f3a-59dc-86a5-e8828fc78e99',1,'money','پول','spoken & written','to put or keep money in a bank','[ transitive ]',null,'برای گذاشتن یا نگهداری پول در بانک','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Did you bank that check?","translation":"آن چک را بانک کردی؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001673862.mp3"},{"sentence":"Who do you bank with?","translation":"با چه کسی بانک می کنید؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001673868.mp3"},{"sentence":"I’ve always banked at First Interstate.","translation":"من همیشه در First Interstate بانک کرده ام.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001673871.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('b5d36bad-e4d3-5d68-b2c1-8da0cbdb20d7','e1af40e3-3f3a-59dc-86a5-e8828fc78e99',2,'plane','هواپیما','spoken & written','if a plane banks, it slopes to one side when turning','[ intransitive ]',null,'اگر هواپيما بريزد، هنگام چرخش به يك طرف شيب دارد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The plane banked, and circled back toward us.","translation":"هواپیما روی زمین نشست و به سمت ما چرخید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001002108.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('560df958-91ee-5552-8bb5-7ce86dcad106','e1af40e3-3f3a-59dc-86a5-e8828fc78e99',3,'pile/rows','شمع/ردیف','spoken & written','to arrange something into a pile or into rows','[ transitive ]',null,'چیدن چیزی به صورت توده یا ردیف','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Snow was banked up on either side of the road.","translation":"برف در دو طرف جاده جمع شده بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001002119.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('0e98ffa9-9d74-58dd-9e9e-6dad06466655','e1af40e3-3f3a-59dc-86a5-e8828fc78e99',4,'cloud/mist','ابر/مه','spoken & written','to form a mass of cloud, mist etc','[ transitive ]',null,'برای تشکیل توده ای از ابر، مه و غیره','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Banked clouds promised rain.","translation":"ابرهای کرانه ای نوید باران را می دادند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001002129.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('a8ce2fb2-b1e5-5177-ba44-98ba05dc18db','e1af40e3-3f3a-59dc-86a5-e8828fc78e99',5,'fire','آتش','spoken & written','to cover a fire with wood or coal to keep it going for a long time','[ transitive ]',null,'روی آتش را با چوب یا زغال بپوشانند تا برای مدت طولانی ادامه داشته باشد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Josie banked up the fire to last till morning.","translation":"جوزی آتش را تا صبح ادامه داد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001002139.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('9ce8fe32-b552-55db-8cf2-ea0708b8b205','3b8af7a7-48d3-51e2-884e-9334e4adb598',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to have your main place of work, business etc in a particular place','[ transitive ]','based','مقر داشتن (در جایی)؛ مستقر کردن','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The paper had intended to base itself in London.","translation":"این روزنامه قصد داشت در لندن مستقر شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001987315.mp3"},{"sentence":"The new organization will be based in Dallas.","translation":"سازمان جدید در دالاس مستقر خواهد شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001987318.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('ffac875a-b92a-52f1-b00f-3c07ee90e52f','a010d5e7-fdfb-511a-8c77-27759e793ca7',1,'lowest part','پایین ترین قسمت','spoken & written','the lowest part or surface of something','[ countable usually singular ]',null,'قاعده، پایه؛ مبنا؛ مقر',array['bottom','bottom']::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"There is a door at the base of the tower.","translation":"دری در پایه برج وجود دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001658661.mp3"},{"sentence":"the base of a triangle","translation":"پایه یک مثلث","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001658662.mp3"},{"sentence":"a frozen dessert with a biscuit base","translation":"یک دسر منجمد با پایه بیسکویت","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001658663.mp3"},{"sentence":"a wine glass with a heavy base","translation":"یک لیوان شراب با پایه سنگین","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001658664.mp3"},{"sentence":"The leather of his left trainer was coming away from its rubber base.","translation":"چرم مربی سمت چپش از پایه لاستیکی اش دور می شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001658665.mp3"},{"sentence":"a hole in the base of the tree","translation":"یک سوراخ در پایه درخت","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001658670.mp3"},{"sentence":"He was killed by an axe blow to the base of his skull.","translation":"او بر اثر ضربه تبر به قاعده جمجمه اش کشته شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001658671.mp3"}]'::jsonb,7),
('876232db-7d8d-5caf-8af9-279c2904eea2','a010d5e7-fdfb-511a-8c77-27759e793ca7',2,'knowledge/ideas','دانش/ایده ها','spoken & written','the most important part of something, from which new ideas develop','[ countable ]',null,'مهمترین بخش چیزی است که از آن ایده های جدید ایجاد می شود',array['foundation']::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a good base This data provided a good base for further research.','a solid/firm/strong base A good education should give you a solid base for life.','a sound/secure base A child needs a responsive mother in order to form a secure base for future development.','a broad base The first year of the course aims to provide students with a broad base of knowledge.','a knowledge base You’re building up a knowledge base that you’ll be able to use later.','have a base Permanent staff have a better base from which to plan their career development.','provide a base It is essential to provide a sound base from which economic progress can be made.','build a base By concentrating on our core businesses we will build a strong base from which to exploit future opportunities.','give somebody a base The training gives you a broad base in actually running an organization.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"India has a good scientific research base.","translation":"هند پایگاه تحقیقاتی علمی خوبی دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001003204.mp3"},{"sentence":"They were laying the base for a new economic recovery.","translation":"آنها پایه‌های یک بهبود اقتصادی جدید را می‌گذاشتند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001658675.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('da08c66f-3768-5a41-9f04-9f6c1752b999','a010d5e7-fdfb-511a-8c77-27759e793ca7',3,'military','نظامی','spoken & written','a place where people in a military organization live and work','[ countable ]',null,'مکانی که در آن افراد در یک سازمان نظامی زندگی و کار می کنند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('0699b155-a649-598d-a69e-5e29d7ed3c1d','a010d5e7-fdfb-511a-8c77-27759e793ca7',4,'company/organization','شرکت/سازمان','spoken & written','the main place from which a person, company, or organization controls their activities','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'مکان اصلی که یک شخص، شرکت یا سازمان از آنجا فعالیت های خود را کنترل می کند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"He used the house as a base for his printing business.","translation":"او از خانه به عنوان پایگاهی برای کار چاپ خود استفاده می کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001658684.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('6619c295-5ecb-5f1c-a7b1-3e02270d9a8a','a010d5e7-fdfb-511a-8c77-27759e793ca7',5,'people/groups','افراد/گروه ها','spoken & written','the people, money, groups etc that form the main part of something','[ countable usually singular ]','power base','مردم، پول، گروه ها و غیره که بخش اصلی چیزی را تشکیل می دهند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The company has built up a loyal customer base .","translation":"این شرکت یک پایگاه مشتری وفادار ایجاد کرده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001658686.mp3"},{"sentence":"By broadening the tax base (= all the people who pay taxes ) , he could raise more revenues.","translation":"با گسترش پایه مالیاتی (= همه افرادی که مالیات می پردازند)، او می تواند درآمد بیشتری کسب کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001658691.mp3"},{"sentence":"an attempt to strengthen the city’s economic base (= things that produce jobs and money )","translation":"تلاش برای تقویت پایه اقتصادی شهر (= چیزهایی که شغل و پول تولید می کند)","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001658696.mp3"},{"sentence":"The country’s manufacturing base (= all the factories, companies etc that produce goods in a country ) has shrunk by 20%.","translation":"پایگاه تولیدی کشور (= تمامی کارخانه ها، شرکت ها و غیره که در یک کشور کالا تولید می کنند) 20 درصد کوچک شده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001003235.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('a02f0277-d5bb-5195-b0ea-8f8d0a973cda','a010d5e7-fdfb-511a-8c77-27759e793ca7',6,'substance/mixture','ماده/مخلوط','spoken & written','the main part of a substance , meal etc to which other things are added','[ singular, uncountable ]',null,'قسمت اصلی یک ماده، غذا و غیره که چیزهای دیگری به آن اضافه می شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"paint with an oil base","translation":"با پایه روغن رنگ کنید","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001003246.mp3"},{"sentence":"Vodka is the base for many cocktails.","translation":"ودکا پایه بسیاری از کوکتل ها است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001658707.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('c5cd55ed-3dc5-5456-a854-60423ad755a7','a010d5e7-fdfb-511a-8c77-27759e793ca7',7,'sport','ورزش','spoken & written','one of the four places that a player must touch in order to get a point in games such as baseball','[ countable ]',null,'یکی از چهار مکانی که یک بازیکن برای کسب امتیاز در بازی هایی مانند بیس بال باید لمس کند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
