('ebfb5533-b218-5ce9-8156-4481594ee2d3','72051673-f1d5-5fab-952b-5b86244d6a66',13,'do before somebody else','قبل از شخص دیگری انجام دهید','informal','to get or do something before someone else, especially if you are both trying to do it first','[ transitive ]',null,'به دست آوردن یا انجام کاری قبل از شخص دیگری، به خصوص اگر هر دوی شما در ابتدا سعی در انجام آن دارید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['easily beat somebody Jason easily beats me at chess every time we play.','narrowly beat somebody (= by only a few points, votes etc ) New Zealand narrowly beat the Springboks in South Africa.','comfortably beat somebody (= by more than a few points, votes etc ) He comfortably beat the second placed candidate.','soundly beat somebody (= by a lot of points, votes etc ) In each event she soundly beat her opponents.','beat somebody hands down (= beat someone very easily ) He should be able to beat them all hands down.','comprehensively beat somebody (= by a lot of points, votes etc ) There’s no point trying to offer excuses as to why we were so comprehensively beaten.','convincingly beat somebody (= in a way that clearly shows someone deserves to win ) Mexico convincingly beat Brazil 2–0.','beat somebody into second/third etc place He was beaten into second place in the Monaco Grand Prix.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"John had beaten me to the breakfast table.","translation":"جان مرا به میز صبحانه کوبیده بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001651650.mp3"},{"sentence":"I wanted the last piece of pie, but somebody beat me to it .","translation":"من آخرین تکه پای را می خواستم، اما یکی مرا به آن کوبید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001006492.mp3"},{"sentence":"They wanted to make it into a film, but another studio beat them to the punch .","translation":"آنها می خواستند آن را به یک فیلم تبدیل کنند، اما یک استودیوی دیگر آنها را شکست داد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001651656.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
