('92948442-d4d3-5aaa-a03f-aae27e38b9be','a3deb460-d9e6-5e88-b80e-6feed451f80b',1,null,null,'spoken & written','an alcoholic drink made from malt and hop s','[ uncountable ]',null,'آبجو، ماءالشعیر','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['cold/ice-cold beer He opened the fridge and got out a can of ice-cold beer.','draught beer British English , draft beer American English (= taken from a large container, not served in a bottle ) He only ever drinks draught beer.','bottled beer (= served in a bottle ) We sell a wide selection of draught and bottled beers.','strong beer (= with a lot of alcohol ) He had drunk two pints of strong beer before attempting to drive.','light beer especially American English (= lower in alcohol or calories than normal beer ) He claims light beer has no flavor.','low-alcohol beer (= lower in alcohol than normal beer ) Have you tried low-alcohol beer?','alcohol-free beer (= with no alcohol in it ) I''ll bring some alcohol-free beer.','stale beer (= old beer which has an unpleasant smell ) The hotel smelt of cigarette smoke and stale beer.','a beer bottle/can (= a bottle/can for beer ) Empty beer cans littered the ground.','a beer barrel/keg (= a large container for beer ) They rolled empty beer barrels along the street.','a beer mat (= a mat for putting a glass of beer on ) There were beer mats and an ashtray on the table.','a beer glass He raised his beer glass and said ''Cheers!''','a beer mug (= large glass with a handle ) The barmaid brought over four foaming beer mugs.','a beer drinker I''m not really a beer drinker.','a beer festival (= special event where people can taste different types of beer )','a pint of beer Two pints of beer, please.','a bottle/can of beer (= containing beer ) The fridge was full of cans of beer.','a barrel of beer (= a large container containing beer ) He bought a barrel of beer for the party.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"a pint of beer","translation":"یک پیمانه آبجو","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001011053.mp3"},{"sentence":"We sell draught beer (= beer served from a large container, not a bottle ) .","translation":"ما آبجو را می فروشیم (= آبجو که از یک ظرف بزرگ سرو می شود، نه یک بطری).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001674938.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('d29ee8da-7920-5382-be3b-4216dec94ef5','a3deb460-d9e6-5e88-b80e-6feed451f80b',2,null,null,'spoken & written','a glass , bottle , or can of beer','[ countable ]',null,'یک لیوان، بطری یا قوطی آبجو','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['cold/ice-cold beer He opened the fridge and got out a can of ice-cold beer.','draught beer British English , draft beer American English (= taken from a large container, not served in a bottle ) He only ever drinks draught beer.','bottled beer (= served in a bottle ) We sell a wide selection of draught and bottled beers.','strong beer (= with a lot of alcohol ) He had drunk two pints of strong beer before attempting to drive.','light beer especially American English (= lower in alcohol or calories than normal beer ) He claims light beer has no flavor.','low-alcohol beer (= lower in alcohol than normal beer ) Have you tried low-alcohol beer?','alcohol-free beer (= with no alcohol in it ) I''ll bring some alcohol-free beer.','stale beer (= old beer which has an unpleasant smell ) The hotel smelt of cigarette smoke and stale beer.','a beer bottle/can (= a bottle/can for beer ) Empty beer cans littered the ground.','a beer barrel/keg (= a large container for beer ) They rolled empty beer barrels along the street.','a beer mat (= a mat for putting a glass of beer on ) There were beer mats and an ashtray on the table.','a beer glass He raised his beer glass and said ''Cheers!''','a beer mug (= large glass with a handle ) The barmaid brought over four foaming beer mugs.','a beer drinker I''m not really a beer drinker.','a beer festival (= special event where people can taste different types of beer )','a pint of beer Two pints of beer, please.','a bottle/can of beer (= containing beer ) The fridge was full of cans of beer.','a barrel of beer (= a large container containing beer ) He bought a barrel of beer for the party.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Do you fancy a beer?","translation":"آیا مایل به آبجو هستید؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001011059.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('0b09544e-202d-5e53-adb6-384826e8732a','3107adbb-ff99-5a03-8692-259f37f50632',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a piece of electrical equipment that makes a ringing sound, used as a signal or to get someone’s attention',null,null,'زنگ (درب، مدرسه)؛ جینگل؛ اجاق‌زنگ','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"He rang the bell and waited for someone to answer the door.","translation":"زنگ را زد و منتظر ماند تا کسی در را پاسخ دهد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001671225.mp3"},{"sentence":"She pressed the bell for the nurse.","translation":"زنگ را برای پرستار فشار داد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce6exa_00095.mp3"},{"sentence":"The bell went and everyone rushed out of the classroom.","translation":"زنگ به صدا در آمد و همه با عجله از کلاس بیرون رفتند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001671228.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('fdc9f9af-3886-5051-8289-751977d9e1c5','3107adbb-ff99-5a03-8692-259f37f50632',2,null,null,'spoken & written','a hollow metal object like a cup with a piece of metal hanging inside it, that makes a ringing noise when it moves or you shake it',null,null,'یک شی فلزی توخالی مانند یک فنجان با یک تکه فلز در داخل آن آویزان است که هنگام حرکت یا تکان دادن آن صدای زنگ می دهد.','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a bell rings I could hear the church bells ringing in the distance.','ring a bell He was ringing a big brass bell.','a bell rings out (= it rings loudly ) The bells rang out to celebrate the end of the war.','a bell sounds Somewhere across the valley a bell sounded.','a bell chimes (= it rings a certain number of times, in order to tell you the time of day ) The bells began to chime, calling people to church.','a bell tolls (= it slowly rings with a long low sound, when someone has died ) The church bell was tolling mournfully as the carriage entered the cemetery gate.','a bell tinkles (= a small bell rings with a gentle high sound ) We were sleeping under the stars, camel bells tinkling in a cool breeze.','a church bell She woke on Sunday morning to the sound of church bells.','wedding bells (= rung when people marry in a church ) Mark and Bridget seem very happy and we expect to hear wedding bells soon.','a peal of bells (= the sound of bells being rung several times ) From the temple he could hear the peal of bells.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"church bells","translation":"ناقوس های کلیسا","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001693934.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
