('b4f6c34d-50f9-5c76-9432-6b47e8c66caf','d1189b25-cf02-5a05-b61c-17e7b1c691cc',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a vehicle that travels across water',null,'lifeboat , motorboat , powerboat , speedboat , steamboat','قایق، بشکه‌لَنج','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['sail a boat They’re sailing a boat down the coast of Portugal.','row a boat Are you any good at rowing a boat?','take a boat out Why don’t we take the boat out on the river?','steer a boat He steered the boat carefully to the shore.','launch a boat (= put it in the water ) Where’s the best place to launch the boat?','tie up/moor a boat (= tie it to something so that it stays in one place ) You can tie up the boat to that tree. How much does it cost to moor a boat here?','a boat rocks (= moves from side to side in the water ) The little boat was rocking in the wind.','a boat capsizes/overturns (= turns over in the water ) Will stood up suddenly and the boat capsized.','a boat overturns (= turns over in the water )','a boat sinks The boat sank in a storm.','a fishing boat The fishing boats go out to sea early in the morning.','a rowing boat British English','a sailing boat British English','a canal boat ( also a narrow boat British English ) (= for use on canals ) We had a holiday on a canal boat in France.','a pleasure boat (= a small boat that people use on a lake, river etc )','a boat trip You can take a boat trip to the islands nearby.','a boat race There’s a boat race on the river tomorrow.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"a fishing boat","translation":"یک قایق ماهیگیری","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001026021.mp3"},{"sentence":"The boat capsized (= turned over ) in heavy seas.","translation":"قایق در دریای سنگین واژگون شد (= واژگون شد).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa040001.mp3"},{"sentence":"a boat trip around the islands","translation":"سفر با قایق در اطراف جزایر","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa040002.mp3"},{"sentence":"Some of the beaches can only be reached by boat.","translation":"دسترسی به برخی از سواحل فقط با قایق امکان پذیر است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001650019.mp3"},{"sentence":"MacKay said he would sleep on his boat.","translation":"مک کی گفت که در قایق خود خواهد خوابید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001650016.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
