('2f211062-8720-525b-9f07-b4a417aa2508','ded7a485-a2a4-520b-805e-13960f004c28',1,'people/animals','مردم / حیوانات','spoken & written','the physical structure of a person or animal','[ countable ]',null,'بدن؛ جسد؛ گروه (بدنه)؛ تنه','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['the human body There are billions of cells in an adult human body.','the female/male body his drawings of the female body','the upper/lower body Slowly raise your upper body into a sitting position.','somebody’s whole body Her whole body froze with fear.','body weight You have exactly the right body weight for your height.','body temperature Exercise will raise your body temperature.','body size/shape differences in body size and shape','body fluids Replace your body fluids by drinking lots of water.','body fat Males have less body fat than females.','body language (= the movements and expressions that show what you feel ) Nervousness is usually clearly expressed in body language.','body image (= what you think you look like ) People tend to have their own body image fixed in their minds.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"the human body","translation":"بدن انسان","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001026351.mp3"},{"sentence":"My fingers were numb and my whole body ached.","translation":"انگشتانم بی حس شده بود و تمام بدنم درد می کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001650073.mp3"},{"sentence":"Your body temperature is higher in the daytime than at night.","translation":"دمای بدن شما در روز بیشتر از شب است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001026354.mp3"},{"sentence":"For their body size, these birds lay very small eggs.","translation":"این پرندگان نسبت به اندازه بدنشان تخم های بسیار کوچکی می گذارند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001650074.mp3"},{"sentence":"He needs to overcome a negative body image (= what you think about your own body ) .","translation":"او باید بر تصویر منفی بدن (= آنچه در مورد بدن خود فکر می کنید) غلبه کند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001026358.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
