('c4aee475-f1ce-58c5-86db-df91d75ced6d','c6433b9c-ed6e-501d-b735-0dd58bcafeba',7,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'drop the c-bomb/f-bomb','بمب؛ گلوله‌ای که منفجر می‌شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a bomb explodes/goes off Forty people were injured when the bomb exploded. A 200 pound bomb went off in the car park.','set off a bomb ( also detonate a bomb formal ) (= make a bomb explode ) The area was cleared and the police safely detonated the bomb.','drop a bomb (= from a plane ) Government forces began dropping bombs on rebel positions.','a bomb falls on something A bomb fell on the hospital.','plant a bomb (= put a bomb somewhere ) It is thought that right-wing extremists planted the bomb.','a nuclear/hydrogen bomb','an atom/atomic bomb','a neutron bomb (= that kills people but does not damage buildings much )','a car bomb (= that makes a car explode ) The car bomb killed 21 shoppers.','a letter bomb ( also a parcel bomb British English ) (= sent in a letter or parcel ) A second letter bomb was found among the unopened mail.','a time bomb (= that is set to explode at a particular time ) The terrorists’ time bomb was planned to cause the maximum carnage.','a petrol bomb British English (= containing petrol ) A petrol bomb was hurled at police as they chased the car.','a nail bomb (= containing nails )','a cluster bomb (= that sends out smaller bombs when it explodes )','a dirty bomb (= that spreads radioactive material )','a smart bomb (= that is guided to the right place )','a terrorist bomb The aircraft was blown apart by a terrorist bomb.','a suicide bomb (= the person carrying the bomb dies when it explodes ) Each time there is a suicide bomb it is a new blow to peace.','a homemade bomb Officers discovered several homemade bombs in the trunk of his car.','an unexploded bomb The workmen found an unexploded bomb.','a bomb blast/explosion The restaurant was destroyed in a massive bomb blast.','a bomb attack No one has yet claimed responsibility for the bomb attack.','a bomb threat (= when someone leaves a message saying there is a bomb somewhere ) He delayed his flight home because of a bomb threat.','a bomb scare (= when people think there might be a bomb somewhere ) The building was evacuated after a bomb scare.','bomb disposal (= the job of dealing with bombs that have not exploded ) a bomb disposal expert','bomb-making equipment Police found guns and bomb-making equipment in the house.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('6c11f6df-2538-5b98-b501-63a0612d785f','021ab41c-b68b-57b7-83ae-c0315c0e00d8',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to attack a place by leaving a bomb there, or by dropping bombs on it from a plane','[ transitive ]','carpet-bomb , dive-bomb','برای حمله به مکانی با گذاشتن بمب در آنجا، یا با انداختن بمب روی آن از هواپیما','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The town was heavily bombed in World War II.","translation":"این شهر در جنگ جهانی دوم به شدت بمباران شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001027092.mp3"},{"sentence":"Government aircraft have been bombing civilian areas.","translation":"هواپیماهای دولتی مناطق غیرنظامی را بمباران کردند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001681781.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('45725eea-fe0c-5f54-985c-1746dbadfb15','021ab41c-b68b-57b7-83ae-c0315c0e00d8',2,null,null,'informal','to move or drive very quickly','[ intransitive always + adverb/preposition ]',null,'برای حرکت یا رانندگی بسیار سریع','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Suddenly a police car came bombing down the high street.","translation":"ناگهان یک ماشین پلیس با بمب در خیابان بالا آمد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001027100.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('8abd080c-57f6-5655-afbb-6e59cda28cdb','021ab41c-b68b-57b7-83ae-c0315c0e00d8',3,null,null,'informal','to fail a test very badly','[ intransitive, transitive ]',null,'شکست خوردن در یک آزمون بسیار بد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"I bombed my midterm.","translation":"میان ترمم را بمباران کردم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001027107.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('534da06f-dddb-5308-bf2b-dc0d41e51bd5','021ab41c-b68b-57b7-83ae-c0315c0e00d8',4,null,null,'spoken & written','if a play, film, event etc bombs, it is not successful','[ intransitive ]',null,'اگر نمایشنامه، فیلم، رویداد و غیره بمب گذاری شود، موفق نیست','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"His latest play bombed on Broadway.","translation":"آخرین نمایشنامه او در برادوی بمباران شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001027114.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('af88bf86-3249-5f8c-b310-5b7e7599a080','c4746c7d-f340-5c3b-bb7b-aed4b4c2eb90',1,null,null,'spoken & written','one of the hard parts that together form the frame of a human , animal, or fish body','[ countable ]',null,'استخوان؛ مغز استخوان (ماده)؛ استخوانی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['broken The doctor thought that I had a broken bone in my wrist. Luckily the bone wasn''t broken.','a thigh/hip/ankle etc bone He was so thin that his hip bones were sticking out.','human/animal bones They dug up a lot of human bones from under the castle.','break a bone I hope you haven''t broken a bone.','fracture a bone (= to break a bone so that a line appears on the surface ) Sally fell, fracturing a bone in her leg.','bone structure (= the shape of your face, formed by the bones in it ) She had beautiful eyes and fine bone structure.','bone disease He suffered from a rare bone disease.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The X-ray showed that the bone was broken in two places.","translation":"اشعه ایکس نشان داد که استخوان از دو نقطه شکسته است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001027383.mp3"},{"sentence":"He broke his collar bone.","translation":"استخوان یقه اش شکست.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001027387.mp3"},{"sentence":"She was tall and big-boned.","translation":"او قد بلند و استخوانی درشت بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001027391.mp3"},{"sentence":"Amelia had inherited her mother’s good bone structure .","translation":"آملیا ساختار استخوانی خوب مادرش را به ارث برده بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001681839.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
