('18b8a497-064e-5d2e-9374-ae2f8c030944','7f3f3ff9-7f65-5d1d-bb7a-5f805117aef5',6,'on a river/harbour','روی یک رودخانه / بندر','spoken & written','something that is stretched across a river or a bay to prevent things floating down or across it','[ countable ]',null,'چیزی که بر روی رودخانه یا خلیج کشیده شده است تا مانع از شناور شدن چیزها به سمت پایین یا روی آن شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['an economic boom the post-war economic boom','a property/housing boom (= a sudden increase in house prices ) People made a lot of money in the 1980s property boom.','a consumer/spending boom (= a sudden increase in the amount people spend ) Various factors caused the consumer boom.','a building/construction boom (= a sudden increase in building work ) There’s been a recent construction boom in the Gulf.','an investment boom the investment boom of the past few years','cause/lead to a boom Tax cuts sometimes lead to an economic boom.','trigger/spark a boom (= start it ) The lower interest rates triggered an economic boom.','fuel a boom (= add to it ) The energy crisis is fuelling a boom in alternative energy.','enjoy a boom Since then, China has enjoyed a remarkable boom.','the boom years/times the boom years of the late 1980s','go from boom to bust (= change from doing very well economically to doing very badly ) The Mexican economy went from boom to bust very quickly.','at the height of the boom They sold their house at the height of the boom.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('28bcae5a-82d5-5676-9834-20966f45bd83','9c45e885-d031-5f59-9502-cb06d48c0dcd',1,null,null,'spoken & written','if business, trade , or a particular area is booming, it is increasing and being very successful','[ intransitive usually in progressive ]',null,'اگر تجارت، تجارت یا یک منطقه خاص رونق داشته باشد، در حال افزایش است و بسیار موفق است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Business was booming , and money wasn’t a problem.","translation":"تجارت رونق داشت و پول مشکلی نبود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000902434.mp3"},{"sentence":"Tourism on the island has boomed.","translation":"گردشگری در این جزیره رونق گرفته است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001649191.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('8b5a96dd-cd6a-5c49-bde6-4d5aae2cb87d','9c45e885-d031-5f59-9502-cb06d48c0dcd',2,null,null,'spoken & written','to say something in a loud deep voice','[ transitive ]',null,'گفتن چیزی با صدای بلند بلند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"‘Ladies and gentlemen, ’ his voice boomed out.","translation":"\"خانم ها و آقایان،\" صدای او بلند شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000902428.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('457f2939-3d64-5100-839a-b0fbff65433c','9c45e885-d031-5f59-9502-cb06d48c0dcd',3,null,null,'spoken & written','to make a loud deep sound','[ intransitive ]',null,'برای ایجاد صدای بلند بلند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Guns boomed in the distance.","translation":"اسلحه ها از دور بلند می شدند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000902422.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('cd21cf94-0ebe-52fe-9dcc-c2a57108d1fb','43edab26-b11b-510a-ad35-d1e5fcf8f981',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a type of shoe that covers your whole foot and the lower part of your leg',null,'rubber boot','چکمه؛ باوت (صندوق عقب ماشین، بریتانیایی)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['leather boots He bought some sturdy leather boots.','wellington boots British English , rubber boots American English (= rubber boots that stop your feet and legs getting wet ) The kids put on their rubber boots and went out in the rain.','walking/hiking boots In the mountains you’ll need some strong walking boots.','football/rugby/riding/ski boots Take your muddy football boots off before you come inside.','ankle boots (= only as high as your ankles ) Ankle boots are fashionable again this autumn.','long boots (= as high as your knees or thighs ) I bought a pair of long leather boots.','knee-high boots She looked fabulous in a mini-skirt and knee-high boots.','a pair of boots I really need a new pair of boots this winter.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"hiking boots","translation":"چکمه های پیاده روی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001649254.mp3"},{"sentence":"a pair of boots","translation":"یک جفت چکمه","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001649255.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
