('fbb5076a-0fa8-5e07-bebe-908fe6e45b29','ff2497c6-a890-599c-bc75-12f876cba996',1,null,null,'spoken & written','money in the form of coins or notes rather than cheques , credit card s etc',null,'hard cash , petty cash','پول نقد، اسکناس و سکه','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Cash was taken during a burglary of the apartment.","translation":"در جریان سرقت از آپارتمان پول نقد برداشت شد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001680145.mp3"},{"sentence":"The traffic police will accept fines in cash immediately.","translation":"پلیس راهنمایی و رانندگی بلافاصله جریمه نقدی می پذیرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001680148.mp3"},{"sentence":"The shop charges less if the customer pays in cash .","translation":"اگر مشتری نقدی پرداخت کند، فروشگاه هزینه کمتری دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001680149.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('39e8eeea-e2b9-59d9-b32a-53750f7a6233','ff2497c6-a890-599c-bc75-12f876cba996',2,null,null,'spoken & written','money',null,null,'پول','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['raise cash She organized a series of events to raise cash for cancer charities.','provide cash Campaigners are urging the government to provide more cash for health care.','generate cash The website generates cash from advertising, and by charging for downloads.','pay (by) cash They won’t take credit cards, so you have to pay cash.','spare cash You should put any spare cash into a savings account.','cash flow (= the amount of money coming into a business compared to money going out ) The company was having a few problems with cash flow.','a cash crisis (= a serious lack of money in an organization or country ) the cash crisis in some developing countries','a cash prize (= a prize that is money ) The winner will get a cash prize of £10,000.','a cash boost (= more money that is suddenly given to a project, business etc ) Conservation projects in the region are being given a cash boost of £40,000.','cash resources The organization’s cash resources are limited.','a cash reserve formal (= an amount of spare money that you have available to use ) Experts always advise people to build up a cash reserve.','a cash crop (= a crop grown to sell rather than to use ) The land is used to grow cash crops like cocoa, tea, and coffee.','be strapped for cash ( also be short of cash ) (= not have enough money ) Many airlines are strapped for cash at the moment.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Health and education need cash from the government.","translation":"بهداشت و آموزش و پرورش به پول نقد دولت نیاز دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001062973.mp3"},{"sentence":"A phone line to help children in trouble has been closed due to lack of cash.","translation":"یک خط تلفن برای کمک به کودکان مشکل دار به دلیل کمبود پول بسته شده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001680157.mp3"},{"sentence":"Charity workers must constantly raise more cash (= collect more money ) for the needy.","translation":"کارکنان خیریه باید دائماً پول نقد بیشتری (= پول بیشتری جمع آوری کنند) برای نیازمندان جمع آوری کنند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001680158.mp3"},{"sentence":"The company found itself strapped for cash (= without enough money ) to pay taxes.","translation":"شرکت خود را برای پرداخت مالیات در تنگنا قرار داد (= بدون پول کافی).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001680165.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
