xaProns/p008-001725810.mp3"},{"sentence":"Shall we go to a club?","translation":"بریم باشگاه؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001086045.mp3"},{"sentence":"I’m not into the club scene at all.","translation":"من اصلا اهل صحنه باشگاه نیستم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001688222.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
