('1c85207c-b56b-5056-bc4e-7d3d284afd9e','fa52f5cf-abc2-5e9e-bce7-51647fe949de',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to hit someone hard with a heavy object',null,null,'ضربه محکمی به کسی با یک جسم سنگین','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"baby seals being clubbed to death","translation":"بچه مهرها با چماق تا سر حد مرگ","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001688034.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('fc39d944-d26b-5680-9bea-6d9be20eb7d2','af62313e-c675-5915-81e5-14f72970427b',1,null,null,'spoken & written','an object or piece of information that helps someone solve a crime or mystery',null,null,'سرنخ، راهنمای حل مسئله؛ راهنما','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['provide a clue Any information could provide the police with useful clues.','hold a clue ( also yield a clue formal ) (= provide one ) The poem itself holds a clue about who it was written for.','leave a clue The bombers may have left behind vital clues.','search (something) for clues Detectives are still searching the house for clues.','look for/hunt for clues Investigators descended on the crime scene hunting for clues.','find a clue No one had found any clues as to where the missing girl could be.','an important/useful/valuable clue The car used in the robbery may provide important clues.','a vital clue (= very important ) A videotape could hold vital clues to the criminal’s identity.','a further clue (= an additional clue ) They searched the surrounding area for further clues.','a search for clues She opened every drawer in her desperate search for clues.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Police have found a vital clue .","translation":"پلیس یک سرنخ حیاتی پیدا کرده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001086156.mp3"},{"sentence":"We now have an important clue as to the time of the murder.","translation":"ما اکنون سرنخ مهمی از زمان قتل داریم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001086159.mp3"},{"sentence":"Archaeological evidence will provide clues about what the building was used for.","translation":"شواهد باستان شناسی سرنخ هایی را در مورد اینکه این بنا برای چه منظوری استفاده شده است، ارائه می دهد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001688270.mp3"},{"sentence":"This information is a valuable clue in our hunt for the bombers.","translation":"این اطلاعات یک سرنخ ارزشمند در شکار ما برای بمب افکن ها است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001688276.mp3"},{"sentence":"a desperate search for clues","translation":"جستجوی ناامیدانه برای سرنخ ها","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001688277.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('1bf6c803-c631-5a62-aaec-36fa1335e894','af62313e-c675-5915-81e5-14f72970427b',2,null,null,'spoken & written','information that helps you understand the reasons why something happens',null,null,'اطلاعاتی که به شما کمک می کند تا دلایل وقوع چیزی را درک کنید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['provide a clue Any information could provide the police with useful clues.','hold a clue ( also yield a clue formal ) (= provide one ) The poem itself holds a clue about who it was written for.','leave a clue The bombers may have left behind vital clues.','search (something) for clues Detectives are still searching the house for clues.','look for/hunt for clues Investigators descended on the crime scene hunting for clues.','find a clue No one had found any clues as to where the missing girl could be.','an important/useful/valuable clue The car used in the robbery may provide important clues.','a vital clue (= very important ) A videotape could hold vital clues to the criminal’s identity.','a further clue (= an additional clue ) They searched the surrounding area for further clues.','a search for clues She opened every drawer in her desperate search for clues.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Childhood experiences may provide a clue as to why some adults develop eating disorders.","translation":"تجربیات دوران کودکی ممکن است سرنخی در مورد اینکه چرا برخی از بزرگسالان دچار اختلالات خوردن می شوند را ارائه دهد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001086201.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
