('ca6e055b-d59c-52c8-84ad-15d5f9fe040b','52f879c9-1922-5bf1-9637-673fe885af94',4,null,null,'spoken & written','a thin layer of a paint or other substance that you spread thinly over the surface of something',null,null,'لایه نازکی از رنگ یا ماده دیگری که به صورت نازک روی سطح چیزی پخش می کنید','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['warm I was wrapped up in a nice warm coat.','heavy/light She was wearing a heavy coat and a thick scarf.','a winter coat You’ll need a good winter coat in Canada.','a waterproof coat I took my walking boots and a waterproof coat.','a trench coat (= a long raincoat with a belt ) a military-style trench coat','a duffle coat (= a warm coat with a hood, and buttons shaped like tubes ) He pulled the hood of his duffle coat over his eyes.','a tweed/wool/sheepskin/leather coat I love her black leather coat.','a fur coat (= made from an animal’s fur ) In Moscow a lot of the women wear fur coats.','a camel coat (= a thick pale brown coat made from wool, sometimes mixed with camel hair ) He wore a smart camel coat over his suit.','a morning coat/tailcoat (= a formal coat that men sometimes wear for weddings )','wear a coat He was wearing a long coat.','put on your coat Mark stood up and put on his coat.','take off/remove your coat She took off her coat and went into the kitchen.','a coat pocket I thought my wallet was in my coat pocket.','a coat sleeve The small boy was pulling at his mother''s coat sleeve.','a coat collar He turned up his coat collar.','a coat hook (= for hanging a coat on a wall ) He hung his jacket on a coat hook in the hall.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"He applied a light coat of varnish.","translation":"او یک پوشش سبک از لاک زد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001086620.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('d68565fb-aa65-58e1-87f9-accbe23484e6','5a0aed5f-5784-51ab-a8e6-48c7d1e48954',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to cover something with a thin layer of something else',null,null,'پوشاندن چیزی با لایه نازکی از چیز دیگری','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"A layer of snow coated the trees.","translation":"لایه ای از برف درختان را پوشانده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000868825.mp3"},{"sentence":"Next, coat the fish with breadcrumbs.","translation":"سپس ماهی را با پودر سوخاری بپوشانید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000868828.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('0d078e41-8b7f-5109-ac60-30a640c5c77f','c7abcb80-c188-5845-8298-e11d31e79fa6',1,'laws/behaviour','قوانین/رفتار','spoken & written','a set of rules , laws, or principles that tell people how to behave','[ countable ]','Highway Code , penal code','رمز، کد؛ قوانین و اصول؛ شناسه','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a code of practice/conduct/ethics (= rules for people in a particular profession or business ) There is a strict code of conduct for doctors.','a code of behaviour Each tribe follows its own code of behaviour.','a code of honour (= a code of behaviour ) The family’s code of honour meant that they had to take revenge.','a moral code Children acquire their parents’ moral code.','a legal code (= rules decided by law ) the legal code on the use of pesticides','a penal/criminal code (= relating to the punishment of criminals ) At that time the penal code allowed the death penalty.','a dress code (= rules about what you must wear ) Some of the more expensive clubs have a dress code.','the Highway Code (= the official rules about driving in Britain ) You will be tested on your knowledge of the Highway Code.','a strict code In future we will have to abide by a strict code of environmental standards.','a voluntary code (= one that people are not legally obliged to follow ) This voluntary code sets standards for retailers on the use of child labour.','have a code Most professional organizations have a code of ethics.','create/produce/establish a code They have established a code of practice for advertisers.','draw up/lay down a code (= create one ) The syndicate decided to draw up a code of conduct for its members.','follow a code When children are near water, it’s important to follow a basic safety code.','comply with/adhere to/conform to a code formal (= follow one ) All staff must sign and strictly adhere to a Code of Business Ethics.','break a code European steel producers were judged to be breaking the code.','breach/violate/contravene a code formal (= break one ) Any companies breaching the code will be expelled from the Association.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"The Torah is the basis for all the Jewish laws and their moral code .","translation":"تورات اساس همه قوانین یهود و قوانین اخلاقی آنهاست.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001692121.mp3"},{"sentence":"Each state in the US has a different criminal and civil code.","translation":"هر ایالت در ایالات متحده قوانین جزایی و مدنی متفاوتی دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001086967.mp3"},{"sentence":"The judge ruled that there had been no breach of the code .","translation":"قاضی حکم داد که هیچ تخلفی از این کد صورت نگرفته است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001692125.mp3"},{"sentence":"There were plans to introduce a dress code (= rules about what to wear ) for civil servants.","translation":"برنامه‌هایی برای معرفی کد لباس (= قوانینی در مورد لباس پوشیدن) برای کارمندان دولت وجود داشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001692128.mp3"},{"sentence":"the strict code of conduct that is so much a part of karate","translation":"قوانین رفتاری سختگیرانه ای که بسیار بخشی از کاراته است","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001086961.mp3"},{"sentence":"The Textile Services Association has drawn up a code of practice endorsed by the Office of Fair Trading.","translation":"انجمن خدمات نساجی آیین نامه ای را تهیه کرده است که توسط دفتر تجارت منصفانه تأیید شده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001692139.mp3"}]'::jsonb,6),
('037c957d-cccb-5d1b-b7db-b12c4546cf1a','c7abcb80-c188-5845-8298-e11d31e79fa6',2,'secret message','پیام مخفی','spoken & written','a system of words, letters , or symbols that you use instead of ordinary writing, so that the information can only be understood by someone else who knows the system','[ countable, uncountable ]',null,'سیستمی از کلمات، حروف یا نمادهایی که به جای نوشتن معمولی استفاده می‌کنید، به طوری که اطلاعات را فقط برای شخص دیگری که سیستم را می‌شناسد قابل درک باشد.','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"All reports must be sent in code.","translation":"همه گزارش ها باید به صورت کد ارسال شوند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001692151.mp3"},{"sentence":"They didn’t realise that we’d broken their secret code.","translation":"آنها متوجه نشدند که ما کد مخفی آنها را شکسته ایم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001692152.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('8b6c9ed1-d817-5c16-a7bd-06d5bbeaab0b','c7abcb80-c188-5845-8298-e11d31e79fa6',3,'symbols giving information','نمادهایی که اطلاعات می دهند','spoken & written','a set of numbers, letters, or symbols that shows what something is or gives information about it','[ countable ]','bar code , genetic code , postcode , zip code','مجموعه ای از اعداد، حروف یا نمادها که نشان می دهد چیزی چیست یا اطلاعاتی در مورد آن می دهد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Goods that you order must have a product code.","translation":"کالاهایی که سفارش می دهید باید دارای کد کالا باشند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001086992.mp3"},{"sentence":"Every item found on the archaeological dig is given a code number .","translation":"به هر موردی که در حفاری های باستان شناسی یافت می شود یک شماره کد داده می شود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001692155.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
