('b07529e1-bcba-5c02-9526-11fe156cdc71','939b64d2-6c4e-5292-95bf-73c8fca365a8',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to succeed in dealing with a difficult problem or situation',null,null,'کنار آمدن، پس خوردن (با مشکل)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['can/can''t cope Older people can''t cope so well with the heat.','be able/unable to cope Some young mothers feel that they aren''t able to cope on their own.','struggle to cope Hospital wards are struggling to cope with the injured.','learn to cope In this job, you''ll have to learn to cope with pressure.','cope well Most schools coped well with the change.','cope easily The exam was tough but she coped easily.','cope successfully Careful planning will help you to cope successfully.','cope admirably She coped admirably with a very demanding schedule.','it is difficult/hard to cope We were finding it difficult to cope financially.','somebody''s ability to cope The bears'' survival will depend on their ability to cope with a changing environment.','a way of coping Working hard was a way of coping with his grief.','coping skills We help people learn coping skills to deal with these pressures.','a coping strategy (= a way of coping with something ) Some people use humour as a coping strategy.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Sometimes I find it hard to cope.","translation":"بعضی وقتا تحملش سخته","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000863508.mp3"},{"sentence":"He coped quite well as manager while still captaining the team.","translation":"او در حالی که هنوز کاپیتان تیم بود، به‌عنوان سرمربی خوب کنار آمد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001686246.mp3"},{"sentence":"She feared she wouldn’t be able to cope with two new babies.","translation":"او می ترسید که نتواند با دو نوزاد جدید کنار بیاید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000863511.mp3"},{"sentence":"Local authorities have to cope with the problems of homelessness.","translation":"مقامات محلی باید با مشکلات بی خانمانی کنار بیایند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001686247.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('25020bf2-1704-587f-b449-613a85c4ca84','939b64d2-6c4e-5292-95bf-73c8fca365a8',2,null,null,'spoken & written','if a system or machine copes with a particular type or amount of work, it does it',null,null,'اگر سیستم یا ماشینی با نوع یا مقدار خاصی از کار کنار بیاید، آن را انجام می دهد','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['can/can''t cope Older people can''t cope so well with the heat.','be able/unable to cope Some young mothers feel that they aren''t able to cope on their own.','struggle to cope Hospital wards are struggling to cope with the injured.','learn to cope In this job, you''ll have to learn to cope with pressure.','cope well Most schools coped well with the change.','cope easily The exam was tough but she coped easily.','cope successfully Careful planning will help you to cope successfully.','cope admirably She coped admirably with a very demanding schedule.','it is difficult/hard to cope We were finding it difficult to cope financially.','somebody''s ability to cope The bears'' survival will depend on their ability to cope with a changing environment.','a way of coping Working hard was a way of coping with his grief.','coping skills We help people learn coping skills to deal with these pressures.','a coping strategy (= a way of coping with something ) Some people use humour as a coping strategy.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"No system is designed to cope with the floods we have had this year.","translation":"هیچ سیستمی برای مقابله با سیل هایی که امسال داشتیم طراحی نشده است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001686250.mp3"},{"sentence":"My computer can cope with huge amounts of data.","translation":"کامپیوتر من می تواند با حجم عظیمی از داده ها کنار بیاید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001686251.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('8f5eaac9-160d-546c-acc4-fde84c398535','acdcc181-67ce-50a4-8ee6-5dea93b71356',1,null,null,'spoken & written','a long loose piece of clothing worn by priests on special occasions',null,null,'یک تکه لباس بلند گشاد که کشیش ها در مناسبت های خاص می پوشند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('aa2a813e-9286-578c-acd0-54fbfb9261e6','16a0a5da-a79c-5cf9-9875-4c7cfa9e8c05',1,null,null,'spoken & written','something that is made to be exactly like another thing','[ countable ]',null,'رونوشت، نسخه؛ نمونه؛ رونویسی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['be a copy of something The rug is a copy of a fine Chinese carpet.','make a copy of something Make a copy of the letter before you send it.','keep a copy of something ( also retain a copy of something formal ) Did you keep a copy of the email?','send/receive a copy of something Could you send me a copy of the agreement?','attach a copy of something (= in an email ) I’m attaching a copy of the schedule.','a good copy (= one that is very like the original ) The painting is a good copy of the original.','a close copy (= a good copy ) It is a close copy of a bronze figure found in Iceland.','a back-up copy (= made in case the original is lost ) Be sure you regularly make back-up copies of your data.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"She forwarded them a copy of her British passport.","translation":"او یک کپی از پاسپورت بریتانیایی خود را برای آنها ارسال کرد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001111038.mp3"},{"sentence":"This chair is a copy of an original design.","translation":"این صندلی کپی طرح اصلی می باشد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001686554.mp3"},{"sentence":"Be sure to make copies of all the documents.","translation":"حتما از تمام مدارک کپی تهیه کنید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001686555.mp3"},{"sentence":"back-up copies of your files","translation":"نسخه پشتیبان از فایل های شما","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001686559.mp3"}]'::jsonb,4),
('b8aad6e6-35e1-597f-869c-51bbca07a919','16a0a5da-a79c-5cf9-9875-4c7cfa9e8c05',2,null,null,'spoken & written','one of many books, magazines , records etc that are all exactly the same','[ countable ]',null,'یکی از بسیاری از کتاب ها، مجلات، سوابق و غیره که همه دقیقاً یکسان هستند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['be a copy of something The rug is a copy of a fine Chinese carpet.','make a copy of something Make a copy of the letter before you send it.','keep a copy of something ( also retain a copy of something formal ) Did you keep a copy of the email?','send/receive a copy of something Could you send me a copy of the agreement?','attach a copy of something (= in an email ) I’m attaching a copy of the schedule.','a good copy (= one that is very like the original ) The painting is a good copy of the original.','a close copy (= a good copy ) It is a close copy of a bronze figure found in Iceland.','a back-up copy (= made in case the original is lost ) Be sure you regularly make back-up copies of your data.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"We have six copies of the movie to give away.","translation":"ما شش نسخه از فیلم را برای تقدیم داریم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001111048.mp3"},{"sentence":"a copy of the local newspaper","translation":"یک نسخه از روزنامه محلی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001686562.mp3"},{"sentence":"The hardback costs £16.99 a copy.","translation":"نسخه گالینگور 16.99 پوند قیمت دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001686563.mp3"},{"sentence":"The record sold a million copies.","translation":"این رکورد یک میلیون نسخه فروخت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001686564.mp3"},{"sentence":"Free copies are available on request.","translation":"نسخه های رایگان در صورت درخواست موجود است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001686565.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('3c91a90a-b257-5802-aa98-ad08c943c2ff','16a0a5da-a79c-5cf9-9875-4c7cfa9e8c05',3,null,null,'technical','something written in order to be printed in a newspaper , magazine, advertisement etc','[ uncountable ]',null,'چیزی که برای چاپ در روزنامه، مجله، آگهی و غیره نوشته شده است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['be a copy of something The rug is a copy of a fine Chinese carpet.','make a copy of something Make a copy of the letter before you send it.','keep a copy of something ( also retain a copy of something formal ) Did you keep a copy of the email?','send/receive a copy of something Could you send me a copy of the agreement?','attach a copy of something (= in an email ) I’m attaching a copy of the schedule.','a good copy (= one that is very like the original ) The painting is a good copy of the original.','a close copy (= a good copy ) It is a close copy of a bronze figure found in Iceland.','a back-up copy (= made in case the original is lost ) Be sure you regularly make back-up copies of your data.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"Now that I’ve seen the finished copy, I’m delighted.","translation":"اکنون که نسخه تمام شده را دیدم، خوشحالم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001111055.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('9b900161-f725-5950-a9ef-8824f2b8ccc6','16a0a5da-a79c-5cf9-9875-4c7cfa9e8c05',4,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'good copy','رونوشت، نسخه؛ نمونه؛ رونویسی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['be a copy of something The rug is a copy of a fine Chinese carpet.','make a copy of something Make a copy of the letter before you send it.','keep a copy of something ( also retain a copy of something formal ) Did you keep a copy of the email?','send/receive a copy of something Could you send me a copy of the agreement?','attach a copy of something (= in an email ) I’m attaching a copy of the schedule.','a good copy (= one that is very like the original ) The painting is a good copy of the original.','a close copy (= a good copy ) It is a close copy of a bronze figure found in Iceland.','a back-up copy (= made in case the original is lost ) Be sure you regularly make back-up copies of your data.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('c6aae81d-334b-5dbd-8bb6-1eb46367036b','b484af34-66ca-58cf-8f91-2d51cfdb440f',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to deliberately make or produce something that is exactly like another thing','[ intransitive, transitive ]',null,'رونویسی کردن، کپی برداری کردن؛ تقلید کردن','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Could you copy this letter and send it out, please?","translation":"لطفاً می توانید این نامه را کپی کنید و بفرستید؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000864474.mp3"},{"sentence":"To copy a file, press F3.","translation":"برای کپی کردن یک فایل، F3 را فشار دهید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001686281.mp3"},{"sentence":"a design copied from an 18th-century wallpaper","translation":"طرحی کپی شده از یک کاغذ دیواری قرن هجدهم","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001686284.mp3"},{"sentence":"The pupils just copy from textbooks and learn facts.","translation":"دانش آموزان فقط از کتاب های درسی کپی می کنند و حقایق را یاد می گیرند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001686285.mp3"},{"sentence":"He copied the number into his notebook (= wrote the same number there ) .","translation":"شماره را در دفتر خود کپی کرد (= همان شماره را در آنجا نوشت) .","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001686288.mp3"}]'::jsonb,5),
('8dbae0bb-8bc2-587b-bed2-7438d1c86ea1','b484af34-66ca-58cf-8f91-2d51cfdb440f',2,null,null,'spoken & written','to deliberately do something that someone else has done or behave like someone else','[ transitive ]',null,'انجام دادن عمدی کاری که شخص دیگری انجام داده است یا مانند شخص دیگری رفتار می کند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Children often copy what they see on television.","translation":"کودکان اغلب آنچه را که در تلویزیون می بینند کپی می کنند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001686292.mp3"},{"sentence":"I found myself copying him and his mannerisms.","translation":"متوجه شدم که از او و رفتارهایش کپی می کنم.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001686293.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('0dea7555-9228-5499-9872-e60b39038135','b484af34-66ca-58cf-8f91-2d51cfdb440f',3,null,null,'spoken & written','to cheat in an examination , schoolwork etc by looking at someone else’s work and writing the same thing as they have','[ intransitive, transitive ]',null,'تقلب در امتحان، تکالیف مدرسه و غیره با نگاه کردن به کار دیگران و نوشتن همان چیزی که آنها دارند.','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Jeremy had copied from the girl next to him.","translation":"جرمی از دختر کنارش کپی کرده بود.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000864489.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('dfda5e2b-8753-57d3-b076-380c87ee2489','5a3d61b8-544f-5fdd-9a71-3dd859602ecf',1,'fruit','میوه','spoken & written','the hard central part of a fruit such as an apple',null,null,'چوب (میوه)؛ هسته اصلی، مغز؛ مرکز (آموزش)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Remove the cores, and bake the apples for 40 minutes.","translation":"هسته ها را بردارید و سیب ها را به مدت 40 دقیقه بپزید.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001111180.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('4769189f-d206-5c0d-8d59-c2bbe92c8496','5a3d61b8-544f-5fdd-9a71-3dd859602ecf',2,'most important part','مهمترین قسمت','spoken & written','the most important or central part of something',null,null,'مهمترین یا مرکزی ترین بخش چیزی','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The core of the book focuses on the period between 1660 and 1857.","translation":"هسته اصلی کتاب بر دوره بین 1660 و 1857 متمرکز است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001686585.mp3"},{"sentence":"Debt is at the core of the problem.","translation":"بدهی هسته اصلی مشکل است.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001686586.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
('479ef12e-8166-5cdd-bad2-c9bb6d7b900e','5a3d61b8-544f-5fdd-9a71-3dd859602ecf',3,'people','مردم','spoken & written','a number of people who form a group which is very important to an organization',null,'hard core','تعدادی از افرادی که گروهی را تشکیل می دهند که برای یک سازمان بسیار مهم است','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The business needs a new core of trained administrators.","translation":"کسب و کار به یک هسته جدید از مدیران آموزش دیده نیاز دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001111198.mp3"},{"sentence":"a core group of clients","translation":"یک گروه اصلی از مشتریان","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001686588.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
