('8db1a0ed-8570-5204-87f9-6e453ab49cf2','8b53903c-c4e9-5995-afde-ce18840eac4f',1,null,null,'spoken & written','to have a particular price','[ linking verb ]',null,'بها داشتن، قیمتش … بود؛ موجب زیان شدن','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['cost a lot Their hair products are really good but they cost a lot.','not cost much Second hand clothes don’t cost much.','cost something per minute/hour/year etc Calls cost only 2p per minute.','cost something per person There’s a one-day course that costs £80 per person.','cost something per head (= per person ) The meal will cost about £20 per head.','not cost (somebody) a penny (= cost nothing ) Using the Internet, you can make phone calls that don’t cost a penny.','cost a fortune/cost the earth (= have a very high price ) If you use a lawyer, it will cost you a fortune.','cost a bomb/a packet British English (= have a very high price ) He has a new sports car that must have cost a bomb.','cost an arm and a leg (= have a price that is much too high ) A skiing holiday needn’t cost you an arm and a leg.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"A full day’s activities will cost you £45.","translation":"فعالیت یک روز کامل 45 پوند برای شما هزینه دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001683927.mp3"},{"sentence":"His proposals could cost the taxpayer around £8 billion a year.","translation":"پیشنهادهای او ممکن است سالانه حدود 8 میلیارد پوند برای مالیات دهندگان هزینه داشته باشد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001683928.mp3"},{"sentence":"How much would it cost us to replace?","translation":"هزینه تعویض آن چقدر است؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001683929.mp3"},{"sentence":"It won’t cost you a penny for the first six months.","translation":"برای شش ماه اول یک پنی برای شما هزینه نخواهد داشت.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001683933.mp3"},{"sentence":"It’s costing us a fortune in phone bills.","translation":"این برای ما هزینه زیادی در قبض تلفن دارد.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001112084.mp3"},{"sentence":"What a fantastic dress. It must have cost a bomb!","translation":"چه لباس فوق العاده ای باید قیمتش یک بمب بوده باشد!","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001112088.mp3"},{"sentence":"Lighting can change the look of a room and needn’t cost the earth (= have a price which is too high ) .","translation":"نورپردازی می تواند ظاهر یک اتاق را تغییر دهد و نیازی به هزینه ای برای زمین نداشته باشد (= قیمت بسیار بالایی داشته باشد).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001683935.mp3"},{"sentence":"Getting that insured is going to cost you an arm and a leg (= have a very high price ) .","translation":"گرفتن آن بیمه برای شما یک دست و یک پا تمام می کند (= قیمت بسیار بالایی دارد).","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001683940.mp3"},{"sentence":"Tickets cost $15.","translation":"قیمت بلیط 15 دلار است.","audio_url":null},{"sentence":"A second-hand car doesn’t cost much.","translation":"ماشین دست دوم هزینه زیادی ندارد.","audio_url":null}]'::jsonb,10),
('2014414b-6b31-5b74-8195-3d58a7a9296f','8b53903c-c4e9-5995-afde-ce18840eac4f',2,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'cost somebody their job/life/marriage etc','بها داشتن، قیمتش … بود؛ موجب زیان شدن','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['cost a lot Their hair products are really good but they cost a lot.','not cost much Second hand clothes don’t cost much.','cost something per minute/hour/year etc Calls cost only 2p per minute.','cost something per person There’s a one-day course that costs £80 per person.','cost something per head (= per person ) The meal will cost about £20 per head.','not cost (somebody) a penny (= cost nothing ) Using the Internet, you can make phone calls that don’t cost a penny.','cost a fortune/cost the earth (= have a very high price ) If you use a lawyer, it will cost you a fortune.','cost a bomb/a packet British English (= have a very high price ) He has a new sports car that must have cost a bomb.','cost an arm and a leg (= have a price that is much too high ) A skiing holiday needn’t cost you an arm and a leg.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
