('ff54d4a5-1113-5295-909b-f2a9d16724af','8b53903c-c4e9-5995-afde-ce18840eac4f',5,null,null,'spoken & written',null,null,'it will cost you','بها داشتن، قیمتش … بود؛ موجب زیان شدن','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['cost a lot Their hair products are really good but they cost a lot.','not cost much Second hand clothes don’t cost much.','cost something per minute/hour/year etc Calls cost only 2p per minute.','cost something per person There’s a one-day course that costs £80 per person.','cost something per head (= per person ) The meal will cost about £20 per head.','not cost (somebody) a penny (= cost nothing ) Using the Internet, you can make phone calls that don’t cost a penny.','cost a fortune/cost the earth (= have a very high price ) If you use a lawyer, it will cost you a fortune.','cost a bomb/a packet British English (= have a very high price ) He has a new sports car that must have cost a bomb.','cost an arm and a leg (= have a price that is much too high ) A skiing holiday needn’t cost you an arm and a leg.']::text[],'[]'::jsonb,0),
('7e24b456-aad9-556f-8f43-726a33a71381','abca2496-92fd-52a7-afd2-2125351e6cf5',1,null,null,'spoken & written','all the people who work on a ship or plane','[ countable ]',null,'خدمه، کارکنان (کشتی، هواپیما)','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The plane crashed, killing two of the crew and four passengers.","translation":"این هواپیما سقوط کرد و دو نفر از خدمه و چهار مسافر کشته شدند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001755907.mp3"},{"sentence":"He joined the crew of a large fishing boat.","translation":"او به خدمه یک قایق ماهیگیری بزرگ پیوست.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001755910.mp3"},{"sentence":"a crew member","translation":"یک خدمه","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-001755911.mp3"}]'::jsonb,3),
('5c2f6c87-88ce-507f-801f-7e3be11e051e','abca2496-92fd-52a7-afd2-2125351e6cf5',2,null,null,'spoken & written','a group of people working together with special skills','[ countable ]','ground crew','گروهی از افراد که با مهارت های خاص با هم کار می کنند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],array['a film crew The film crew were making a political documentary.','a camera crew a BBC camera crew','a television/TV crew Journalists and TV crews were waiting outside their house.','a stage crew (= working to produce a play ) There is a cast of 100 and a stage crew of twenty.','a production crew (= working to produce a film, programme, play etc ) She’s a member of the production crew for a new television series.','a fire crew Fire crews took more than three hours to bring the blaze under control.','an ambulance crew The woman had to be rescued from her car by an ambulance crew.','the ground crew (= the people who prepare an airplane to fly ) The ground crew were refueling the plane.','the cabin crew (= the people who work inside an airplane, especially the flight attendants ) I was impressed by the polite and efficient cabin crew.']::text[],'[{"sentence":"a TV camera crew","translation":"یک گروه دوربین تلویزیونی","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000846119.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('78cef5ac-37a6-5d01-8cb0-4d69d9efe74c','abca2496-92fd-52a7-afd2-2125351e6cf5',3,null,null,'spoken & written','a team of people who compete in rowing races','[ countable ]',null,'تیمی از افرادی که در مسابقات قایقرانی شرکت می کنند','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"Who will be on the college crew?","translation":"چه کسی در خدمه کالج خواهد بود؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-000846142.mp3"}]'::jsonb,1),
('7c551496-d54e-5574-b56c-f526436a1d19','abca2496-92fd-52a7-afd2-2125351e6cf5',4,null,null,'spoken & written','a group of people or friends – often used to show disapproval','[ singular ]',null,'گروهی از افراد یا دوستان - اغلب برای نشان دادن عدم تایید استفاده می شود','{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'{}'::text[],'[{"sentence":"The volunteers were a motley crew (= very mixed group of people ) .","translation":"داوطلبان یک خدمه متشکل (= گروه بسیار مختلط از مردم) بودند.","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/ldoce5_exa020042.mp3"},{"sentence":"Do you still hang out with the same crew ?","translation":"آیا هنوز با همان خدمه معاشرت می کنید؟","audio_url":"https://www.ldoceonline.com/media/english/exaProns/p008-002011850.mp3"}]'::jsonb,2),
